{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_76702a6dbf1a4c8aacb93e13","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 汇报状态\n2\t\n3\t完成任务后更新自己的状态文件。\n4\t\n5\t```bash\n6\t# 更新 state.json\n7\t{\n8\t  \"status\": \"idle\",\n9\t  \"last_run\": \"<当前时间>\",\n10\t  \"run_count\": \"<自增>\"\n11\t}\n12\t```\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"3bec4f99-8541-40e8-95e0-2ddaf5a44f6a","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.902Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\report.md","content":"# Skill: 汇报状态\n\n完成任务后更新自己的状态文件。\n\n```bash\n# 更新 state.json\n{\n  \"status\": \"idle\",\n  \"last_run\": \"<当前时间>\",\n  \"run_count\": \"<自增>\"\n}\n```\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_44068185d61646788591b4cf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 收件箱\n2\t\n3\t每个 Agent 有自己的收件箱，用于接收消息和任务结果。\n4\t\n5\t## 位置\n6\t`D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\`\n7\t\n8\t## 用法\n9\t发送消息给某 Agent：\n10\t```\n11\t写入 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\<来源>_<时间戳>.md\n12\t```\n13\t\n14\t格式：\n15\t```markdown\n16\t# 来自 <来源> 的消息\n17\t- 类型：任务结果 / 通知 / 协作请求\n18\t- 内容：...\n19\t```\n20\t\n21\t## 示例\n22\t- `main\\inbox\\code-reviewer_20260521.md` — 代码审查员发给 main 的审查报告\n23\t- `frontend-dev\\inbox\\main_20260521.md` — main 给前端开发者的新需求\n24\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"cbf6963f-ba3e-4e16-a9ef-e5c0899be272","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.913Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\inbox.md","content":"# Skill: 收件箱\n\n每个 Agent 有自己的收件箱，用于接收消息和任务结果。\n\n## 位置\n`D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\`\n\n## 用法\n发送消息给某 Agent：\n```\n写入 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\<来源>_<时间戳>.md\n```\n\n格式：\n```markdown\n# 来自 <来源> 的消息\n- 类型：任务结果 / 通知 / 协作请求\n- 内容：...\n```\n\n## 示例\n- `main\\inbox\\code-reviewer_20260521.md` — 代码审查员发给 main 的审查报告\n- `frontend-dev\\inbox\\main_20260521.md` — main 给前端开发者的新需求\n","numLines":24,"startLine":1,"totalLines":24}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_6b1da4950ed44603bc69a711","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 创建 Agent\n2\t\n3\t从模板库创建新 Agent，自动注册到 loopcli。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```bash\n7\tloopcli create <模板ID> --task \"任务描述\"\n8\t```\n9\t\n10\t## 模板位置\n11\tD:\\loopcli\\subagent\\，按部门分目录。模板文件格式：`<部门>/<模板ID>.md`\n12\t例如：`engineering/engineering-frontend-developer.md`\n13\t\n14\t## 执行逻辑\n15\t1. 从 subagent/<部门>/<模板ID>.md 读取模板内容\n16\t2. 在 D:\\loopcli\\<模板ID>/ 下创建目录结构：\n17\t   - AGENT（标记文件，内容为 `type: main`）\n18\t   - SOUL.md（模板内容）\n19\t   - PROMPT.md（自动生成：读取 SOUL.md，读取 memory/tasks.json，执行任务，更新状态）\n20\t   - memory/tasks.json（含传入的任务）\n21\t   - memory/state.json（初始状态）\n22\t   - log/run.md（空日志）\n23\t3. loopcli 下一轮自动发现并启动该 Agent\n24\t\n25\t## 示例\n26\t```bash\n27\tloopcli create engineering-frontend-developer --task \"开发登录页面\"\n28\tloopcli create engineering-code-reviewer --task \"审查 PR #42\"\n29\tloopcli create design-ui-designer --task \"设计仪表盘界面\"\n30\t```\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"607763df-99c2-42fb-a06a-ecb8296276da","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.914Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\create-agent.md","content":"# Skill: 创建 Agent\n\n从模板库创建新 Agent，自动注册到 loopcli。\n\n## 用法\n```bash\nloopcli create <模板ID> --task \"任务描述\"\n```\n\n## 模板位置\nD:\\loopcli\\subagent\\，按部门分目录。模板文件格式：`<部门>/<模板ID>.md`\n例如：`engineering/engineering-frontend-developer.md`\n\n## 执行逻辑\n1. 从 subagent/<部门>/<模板ID>.md 读取模板内容\n2. 在 D:\\loopcli\\<模板ID>/ 下创建目录结构：\n   - AGENT（标记文件，内容为 `type: main`）\n   - SOUL.md（模板内容）\n   - PROMPT.md（自动生成：读取 SOUL.md，读取 memory/tasks.json，执行任务，更新状态）\n   - memory/tasks.json（含传入的任务）\n   - memory/state.json（初始状态）\n   - log/run.md（空日志）\n3. loopcli 下一轮自动发现并启动该 Agent\n\n## 示例\n```bash\nloopcli create engineering-frontend-developer --task \"开发登录页面\"\nloopcli create engineering-code-reviewer --task \"审查 PR #42\"\nloopcli create design-ui-designer --task \"设计仪表盘界面\"\n```\n","numLines":31,"startLine":1,"totalLines":31}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_420a9783f57c4111bc5b3936","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport argparse\n2\timport json\n3\timport os\n4\timport shutil\n5\timport subprocess\n6\timport sys\n7\timport threading\n8\timport time\n9\tfrom datetime import datetime\n10\t\n11\tLOOPCLI_DIR = r\"D:\\loopcli\"\n12\tSUBAGENT_DIR = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"subagent\")\n13\tCLAUDE = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"APPDATA\", \"\"), \"npm\", \"claude.cmd\")\n14\t\n15\tAGENT_MARKER = \"AGENT\"\n16\tLOGS_DIR = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"logs\")\n17\tGIT_TOKEN_FILE = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \".gittoken\")\n18\tDEFAULT_PROMPT = \"\"\"读取 SOUL.md 作为你的身份。\n19\t读取 D:/loopcli/skill/ 下所有技能文件（全局技能）。\n20\t读取 memory/tasks.json 获取分配给你的任务。\n21\t\n22\t执行步骤：\n23\t1. 从 tasks.json 中找 status 为 \"pending\" 的第一个任务\n24\t2. 执行该任务\n25\t3. 将结果写入 memory/results/ 目录（以时间戳命名）\n26\t4. 将该任务 status 改为 \"done\"，写回 tasks.json\n27\t5. 更新 memory/state.json（标记完成、记录时间戳）\n28\t6. 将本次运行摘要追加到 log/run.md\n29\t7. 通过 inbox 通知 main：写入 D:/loopcli/main/inbox/<你的名字>_<时间>.md，简要报告任务结果\n30\t8. 如果没有 pending 任务，输出 \"IDLE\" 并结束本轮\n31\t\"\"\"\n32\t\n33\t\n34\t# ─── 工具函数 ───\n35\t\n36\tdef discover_agents():\n37\t    agents = []\n38\t    for name in os.listdir(LOOPCLI_DIR):\n39\t        path = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, name)\n40\t        marker = os.path.join(path, AGENT_MARKER)\n41\t        if os.path.isdir(path) and os.path.isfile(marker):\n42\t            agents.append({\"name\": name, \"path\": path})\n43\t    return agents\n44\t\n45\t\n46\tdef find_template(template_id):\n47\t    \"\"\"在 subagent 目录下搜索模板文件\"\"\"\n48\t    for dept in os.listdir(SUBAGENT_DIR):\n49\t        dept_dir = os.path.join(SUBAGENT_DIR, dept)\n50\t        if not os.path.isdir(dept_dir):\n51\t            continue\n52\t        candidate = os.path.join(dept_dir, f\"{template_id}.md\")\n53\t        if os.path.isfile(candidate):\n54\t            return candidate\n55\t    return None\n56\t\n57\t\n58\tdef load_agent_state(agent_path):\n59\t    state_file = os.path.join(agent_path, \"memory\", \"state.json\")\n60\t    if os.path.isfile(state_file):\n61\t        with open(state_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n62\t            return json.load(f)\n63\t    return None\n64\t\n65\t\n66\tdef load_agent_tasks(agent_path):\n67\t    tasks_file = os.path.join(agent_path, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\")\n68\t    if os.path.isfile(tasks_file):\n69\t        with open(tasks_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n70\t            return json.load(f)\n71\t    return []\n72\t\n73\t\n74\t# ─── 子命令: create ───\n75\t\n76\tdef cmd_create(args):\n77\t    template_id = args.template\n78\t    task_desc = args.task or \"\"\n79\t\n80\t    tpl_file = find_template(template_id)\n81\t    if not tpl_file:\n82\t        print(f\"[错误] 找不到模板: {template_id}\")\n83\t        print(\"用 loopcli templates 查看所有可用模板\")\n84\t        sys.exit(1)\n85\t\n86\t    with open(tpl_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n87\t        soul_content = f.read()\n88\t\n89\t    agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, template_id)\n90\t    if os.path.exists(agent_dir):\n91\t        print(f\"[跳过] Agent 已存在: {agent_dir}\")\n92\t        if task_desc:\n93\t            cmd_task_inner(template_id, task_desc, \"\")\n94\t        return\n95\t\n96\t    # 创建目录结构\n97\t    os.makedirs(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"results\"), exist_ok=True)\n98\t    os.makedirs(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"log\"), exist_ok=True)\n99\t\n100\t    # AGENT 标记\n101\t    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n102\t        f.write(\"type: main\\n\")\n103\t\n104\t    # SOUL.md（模板内容）\n105\t    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"SOUL.md\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n106\t        f.write(soul_content)\n107\t\n108\t    # PROMPT.md\n109\t    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"PROMPT.md\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n110\t        f.write(DEFAULT_PROMPT)\n111\t\n112\t    # state.json\n113\t    state = {\"agent\": template_id, \"status\": \"idle\", \"current_task\": None, \"last_run\": None, \"run_count\": 0, \"created\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")}\n114\t    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"state.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n115\t        json.dump(state, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n116\t\n117\t    # tasks.json\n118\t    tasks = []\n119\t    if task_desc:\n120\t        tasks.append({\"id\": 1, \"status\": \"pending\", \"title\": task_desc, \"description\": task_desc, \"created\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"), \"assignee\": template_id})\n121\t    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n122\t        json.dump(tasks, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n123\t\n124\t    # run.md\n125\t    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"log\", \"run.md\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n126\t        f.write(\"# 运行日志\\n\\n| 时间 | 状态 | 任务 | 摘要 |\\n|------|------|------|------|\\n\")\n127\t\n128\t    print(f\"[创建成功] {template_id}\")\n129\t    print(f\"  目录: {agent_dir}\")\n130\t    if task_desc:\n131\t        print(f\"  任务: {task_desc}\")\n132\t    print(f\"  下一轮 loopcli 将自动启动该 Agent\")\n133\t\n134\t\n135\t# ─── 子命令: task ───\n136\t\n137\tdef cmd_task_inner(agent_name, title, desc):\n138\t    agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, agent_name)\n139\t    if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n140\t        print(f\"[错误] 不是有效的 Agent: {agent_name}\")\n141\t        sys.exit(1)\n142\t\n143\t    tasks_file = os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\")\n144\t    tasks = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n145\t    next_id = max((t[\"id\"] for t in tasks), default=0) + 1\n146\t    tasks.append({\n147\t        \"id\": next_id,\n148\t        \"status\": \"pending\",\n149\t        \"title\": title,\n150\t        \"description\": desc or title,\n151\t        \"created\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n152\t        \"assignee\": agent_name\n153\t    })\n154\t    with open(tasks_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n155\t        json.dump(tasks, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n156\t    print(f\"[派发成功] {agent_name} <- #{next_id} {title}\")\n157\t\n158\t\n159\tdef cmd_task(args):\n160\t    cmd_task_inner(args.agent, args.title, args.desc)\n161\t\n162\t\n163\t# ─── 子命令: list ───\n164\t\n165\tdef cmd_list(args):\n166\t    agents = discover_agents()\n167\t    if not agents:\n168\t        print(\"没有发现任何 Agent\")\n169\t        return\n170\t    print(f\"{'Agent':<45} {'状态':<10} {'任务数':<8} {'最后运行'}\")\n171\t    print(\"-\" * 85)\n172\t    for a in agents:\n173\t        state = load_agent_state(a[\"path\"]) or {}\n174\t        tasks = load_agent_tasks(a[\"path\"])\n175\t        pending = len([t for t in tasks if t.get(\"status\") == \"pending\"])\n176\t        status = state.get(\"status\", \"?\")\n177\t        last_run = state.get(\"last_run\", \"-\")\n178\t        print(f\"{a['name']:<45} {status:<10} {pending:<8} {last_run}\")\n179\t\n180\t\n181\t# ─── 子命令: templates ───\n182\t\n183\tdef cmd_templates(args):\n184\t    found = []\n185\t    for dept in sorted(os.listdir(SUBAGENT_DIR)):\n186\t        dept_dir = os.path.join(SUBAGENT_DIR, dept)\n187\t        if not os.path.isdir(dept_dir):\n188\t            continue\n189\t        for fname in sorted(os.listdir(dept_dir)):\n190\t            if fname.endswith(\".md\"):\n191\t                found.append(fname[:-3])\n192\t    if args.filter:\n193\t        found = [t for t in found if args.filter.lower() in t.lower()]\n194\t    print(f\"共 {len(found)} 个模板:\")\n195\t    for t in found:\n196\t        print(f\"  {t}\")\n197\t\n198\t\n199\t# ─── 子命令: run（主循环）───\n200\t\n201\tdef handle_event(agent_name, line):\n202\t    line = line.strip()\n203\t    if not line:\n204\t        return\n205\t    try:\n206\t        event = json.loads(line)\n207\t    except json.JSONDecodeError:\n208\t        print(f\"[{agent_name}] {line}\", flush=True)\n209\t        return\n210\t\n211\t    event_type = event.get(\"type\", \"\")\n212\t\n213\t    if event_type == \"assistant\":\n214\t        msg = event.get(\"message\", {})\n215\t        for block in msg.get(\"content\", []):\n216\t            if block.get(\"type\") == \"text\":\n217\t                text = block.get(\"text\", \"\")\n218\t                if text:\n219\t                    print(f\"[{agent_name}] {text}\", flush=True)\n220\t            elif block.get(\"type\") == \"tool_use\":\n221\t                name = block.get(\"name\", \"\")\n222\t                inp = block.get(\"input\", {})\n223\t                detail = \"\"\n224\t                for k in (\"file_path\", \"command\", \"pattern\"):\n225\t                    if k in inp:\n226\t                        detail = inp[k]\n227\t                        break\n228\t                print(f\"[{agent_name}] ● {name}({detail})\", flush=True)\n229\t\n230\t    elif event_type == \"tool_result\":\n231\t        content = event.get(\"content\", \"\")\n232\t        texts = []\n233\t        if isinstance(content, list):\n234\t            texts = [b.get(\"text\", \"\") for b in content if b.get(\"text\")]\n235\t        elif isinstance(content, str):\n236\t            texts = [content]\n237\t        for text in texts:\n238\t            print(f\"[{agent_name}]   ↳ {text[:200]}\", flush=True)\n239\t\n240\t    elif event_type == \"result\":\n241\t        text = event.get(\"result\", \"\")\n242\t        if text:\n243\t            print(f\"[{agent_name}] [结果] {text[:500]}\", flush=True)\n244\t        cost = event.get(\"cost_usd\", \"\")\n245\t        duration = event.get(\"duration_ms\", \"\")\n246\t        if cost or duration:\n247\t            print(f\"[{agent_name}] [统计] 耗时: {duration}ms, 费用: ${cost}\", flush=True)\n248\t\n249\t    elif event_type == \"error\":\n250\t        print(f\"[{agent_name}] [错误] {event.get('error', '')}\", flush=True)\n251\t\n252\t\n253\tdef run_agent(agent, iteration, run_log_dir):\n254\t    name = agent[\"name\"]\n255\t    path = agent[\"path\"]\n256\t    prompt_file = os.path.join(path, \"PROMPT.md\")\n257\t    log_file_path = os.path.join(path, \"log\", \"raw.log\")\n258\t    run_agent_log = os.path.join(run_log_dir, f\"{name}.log\")\n259\t    ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n260\t\n261\t    if not os.path.isfile(prompt_file):\n262\t        print(f\"[{name}] 没有 PROMPT.md，跳过\", flush=True)\n263\t        return\n264\t\n265\t    with open(prompt_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n266\t        prompt = f.read()\n267\t\n268\t    os.makedirs(os.path.join(path, \"log\"), exist_ok=True)\n269\t    log_file = open(log_file_path, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n270\t    agent_log = open(run_agent_log, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n271\t\n272\t    header = f\"\\n[{ts}] --- 开始 (第{iteration}轮) ---\\n\"\n273\t    log_file.write(header)\n274\t    agent_log.write(header)\n275\t    log_file.flush()\n276\t    agent_log.flush()\n277\t\n278\t    env = {**os.environ, \"IS_SANDBOX\": \"1\"}\n279\t\n280\t    proc = subprocess.Popen(\n281\t        f'\"{CLAUDE}\" --print --verbose --output-format stream-json --dangerously-skip-permissions',\n282\t        stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\n283\t        stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n284\t        stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n285\t        env=env,\n286\t        shell=True,\n287\t        cwd=path,\n288\t    )\n289\t\n290\t    proc.stdin.write(prompt.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n291\t    proc.stdin.close()\n292\t\n293\t    for line in proc.stdout:\n294\t        decoded = line.decode(\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n295\t        log_file.write(decoded)\n296\t        agent_log.write(decoded)\n297\t        log_file.flush()\n298\t        agent_log.flush()\n299\t        handle_event(name, decoded)\n300\t\n301\t    stderr_output = proc.stderr.read().decode(\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n302\t    if stderr_output:\n303\t        print(f\"[{name}] [STDERR] {stderr_output}\", flush=True)\n304\t        log_file.write(stderr_output)\n305\t        agent_log.write(stderr_output)\n306\t\n307\t    proc.wait()\n308\t\n309\t    footer = f\"\\n[{ts}] --- 结束 (exit={proc.returncode}) ---\\n\"\n310\t    log_file.write(footer)\n311\t    agent_log.write(footer)\n312\t    log_file.close()\n313\t    agent_log.close()\n314\t\n315\t    # 更新 state.json\n316\t    state_file = os.path.join(path, \"memory\", \"state.json\")\n317\t    state = load_agent_state(path) or {}\n318\t    state[\"status\"] = \"idle\"\n319\t    state[\"last_run\"] = ts\n320\t    state[\"run_count\"] = state.get(\"run_count\", 0) + 1\n321\t    with open(state_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n322\t        json.dump(state, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n323\t\n324\t    status = \"完成\" if proc.returncode == 0 else f\"异常(exit={proc.returncode})\"\n325\t    print(f\"[{name}] 本轮{status}\", flush=True)\n326\t\n327\t\n328\tdef git_push():\n329\t    \"\"\"自动 commit 和 push 到 GitHub\"\"\"\n330\t    token_file = GIT_TOKEN_FILE\n331\t    if not os.path.isfile(token_file):\n332\t        return\n333\t    token = open(token_file, \"r\").read().strip()\n334\t    if not token:\n335\t        return\n336\t    try:\n337\t        subprocess.run([\"git\", \"add\", \"-A\"], cwd=LOOPCLI_DIR, capture_output=True, timeout=30)\n338\t        subprocess.run(\n339\t            [\"git\", \"commit\", \"-m\", f\"auto: loopcli sync {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')}\"],\n340\t            cwd=LOOPCLI_DIR, capture_output=True, timeout=30\n341\t        )\n342\t        url = f\"https://{token}@github.com/zhoudingnuo/loopcli.git\"\n343\t        subprocess.run([\"git\", \"push\", url, \"main\"], cwd=LOOPCLI_DIR, capture_output=True, timeout=60)\n344\t        print(\"[git] 已同步到 GitHub\", flush=True)\n345\t    except Exception as e:\n346\t        print(f\"[git] 同步失败: {e}\", flush=True)\n347\t\n348\t\n349\tdef cmd_run(args):\n350\t    agents = discover_agents()\n351\t    if not agents:\n352\t        print(\"未发现任何 Agent（需要目录下有 AGENT 标记文件）\")\n353\t        sys.exit(1)\n354\t\n355\t    # 创建本次运行日志目录\n356\t    run_id = datetime.now().strftime(\"run_%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n357\t    run_log_dir = os.path.join(LOGS_DIR, run_id)\n358\t    os.makedirs(run_log_dir, exist_ok=True)\n359\t\n360\t    # 写入运行元信息\n361\t    meta = {\n362\t        \"run_id\": run_id,\n363\t        \"started\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"),\n364\t        \"iterations\": args.iterations or \"无限\",\n365\t        \"agents\": [a[\"name\"] for a in agents],\n366\t    }\n367\t    with open(os.path.join(run_log_dir, \"meta.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n368\t        json.dump(meta, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n369\t\n370\t    print(f\"运行 ID: {run_id}\")\n371\t    print(f\"日志目录: {run_log_dir}\")\n372\t    print(f\"发现 {len(agents)} 个 Agent: {', '.join(a['name'] for a in agents)}\")\n373\t\n374\t    count = 0\n375\t    while args.iterations == 0 or count < args.iterations:\n376\t        count += 1\n377\t        # 每轮重新扫描（可能有新 Agent）\n378\t        agents = discover_agents()\n379\t        ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n380\t        print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n381\t        print(f\"[{ts}] 第 {count}{'/' + str(args.iterations) if args.iterations else ''} 轮 | {len(agents)} 个 Agent\")\n382\t        print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n383\t\n384\t        threads = []\n385\t        for agent in agents:\n386\t            print(f\"\\n--- 启动 [{agent['name']}] ---\", flush=True)\n387\t            t = threading.Thread(target=run_agent, args=(agent, count, run_log_dir))\n388\t            t.start()\n389\t            threads.append(t)\n390\t        for t in threads:\n391\t            t.join()\n392\t\n393\t        # 每轮结束后同步到 GitHub\n394\t        git_push()\n395\t\n396\t        # 等待下一轮\n397\t        if args.iterations == 0 or count < args.iterations:\n398\t            print(f\"\\n等待 {args.wait} 秒后进入下一轮...\", flush=True)\n399\t            time.sleep(args.wait)\n400\t    meta[\"finished\"] = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n401\t    meta[\"total_iterations\"] = count\n402\t    with open(os.path.join(run_log_dir, \"meta.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n403\t        json.dump(meta, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n404\t\n405\t    print(f\"\\n运行结束，日志保存在: {run_log_dir}\")\n406\t\n407\t\n408\t# ─── CLI 入口 ───\n409\t\n410\tparser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\"LoopCLI — 多 Agent 自治系统\")\n411\tsub = parser.add_subparsers(dest=\"command\")\n412\t\n413\t# loopcli run [-n N]\n414\tp_run = sub.add_parser(\"run\", help=\"启动 Agent 循环（默认）\")\n415\tp_run.add_argument(\"-n\", \"--iterations\", type=int, default=0, help=\"迭代次数，0=无限\")\n416\tp_run.add_argument(\"-w\", \"--wait\", type=int, default=10, help=\"每轮间隔秒数（默认 10）\")\n417\t\n418\t# loopcli create <template> [--task TASK]\n419\tp_create = sub.add_parser(\"create\", help=\"从模板创建新 Agent\")\n420\tp_create.add_argument(\"template\", help=\"模板 ID，如 engineering-frontend-developer\")\n421\tp_create.add_argument(\"--task\", \"-t\", help=\"初始任务描述\")\n422\t\n423\t# loopcli task <agent> <title> [--desc DESC]\n424\tp_task = sub.add_parser(\"task\", help=\"给 Agent 派发任务\")\n425\tp_task.add_argument(\"agent\", help=\"Agent 目录名\")\n426\tp_task.add_argument(\"title\", help=\"任务标题\")\n427\tp_task.add_argument(\"--desc\", \"-d\", default=\"\", help=\"任务描述\")\n428\t\n429\t# loopcli list\n430\tsub.add_parser(\"list\", help=\"列出所有 Agent 及状态\")\n431\t\n432\t# loopcli templates [--filter X]\n433\tp_tpl = sub.add_parser(\"templates\", help=\"列出可用模板\")\n434\tp_tpl.add_argument(\"--filter\", \"-f\", default=\"\", help=\"按关键词筛选\")\n435\t\n436\t# loopcli msg <内容> [--agent AGENT]\n437\tp_msg = sub.add_parser(\"msg\", help=\"给 Agent 发消息\")\n438\tp_msg.add_argument(\"content\", help=\"消息内容\")\n439\tp_msg.add_argument(\"--agent\", \"-a\", default=\"main\", help=\"目标 Agent（默认 main）\")\n440\t\n441\t# 预处理：把裸数字参数（如 -n 5）转为 run 子命令\n442\tdef cmd_msg(args):\n443\t    agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, args.agent)\n444\t    inbox = os.path.join(agent_dir, \"inbox\")\n445\t    if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n446\t        print(f\"[错误] 不是有效的 Agent: {args.agent}\")\n447\t        sys.exit(1)\n448\t    os.makedirs(inbox, exist_ok=True)\n449\t    ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M\")\n450\t    msg_file = os.path.join(inbox, f\"user_{ts}.md\")\n451\t    with open(msg_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n452\t        f.write(f\"# 来自 zhoudingnuo 的消息\\n- 类型：指令\\n- 时间：{datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')}\\n\\n## 内容\\n{args.content}\\n\")\n453\t    print(f\"[已发送] -> {args.agent}/inbox/  {args.content}\")\n454\t\n455\t\n456\t# 预处理：把裸数字参数（如 -n 5）转为 run 子命令\n457\tif sys.argv[1:] and sys.argv[1] not in (\"run\", \"create\", \"task\", \"list\", \"templates\", \"msg\", \"-h\", \"--help\"):\n458\t    sys.argv.insert(1, \"run\")\n459\t\n460\targs = parser.parse_args()\n461\t\n462\tif args.command == \"create\":\n463\t    cmd_create(args)\n464\telif args.command == \"task\":\n465\t    cmd_task(args)\n466\telif args.command == \"list\":\n467\t    cmd_list(args)\n468\telif args.command == \"templates\":\n469\t    cmd_templates(args)\n470\telif args.command == \"msg\":\n471\t    cmd_msg(args)\n472\telse:\n473\t    # run 或无子命令\n474\t    if not hasattr(args, \"iterations\"):\n475\t        args.iterations = 0\n476\t    cmd_run(args)\n477\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"417ce58a-8bf2-492f-b6e8-7eca87288177","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.915Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\run.py","content":"import argparse\nimport json\nimport os\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport threading\nimport time\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nLOOPCLI_DIR = r\"D:\\loopcli\"\nSUBAGENT_DIR = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"subagent\")\nCLAUDE = os.path.join(os.environ.get(\"APPDATA\", \"\"), \"npm\", \"claude.cmd\")\n\nAGENT_MARKER = \"AGENT\"\nLOGS_DIR = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"logs\")\nGIT_TOKEN_FILE = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \".gittoken\")\nDEFAULT_PROMPT = \"\"\"读取 SOUL.md 作为你的身份。\n读取 D:/loopcli/skill/ 下所有技能文件（全局技能）。\n读取 memory/tasks.json 获取分配给你的任务。\n\n执行步骤：\n1. 从 tasks.json 中找 status 为 \"pending\" 的第一个任务\n2. 执行该任务\n3. 将结果写入 memory/results/ 目录（以时间戳命名）\n4. 将该任务 status 改为 \"done\"，写回 tasks.json\n5. 更新 memory/state.json（标记完成、记录时间戳）\n6. 将本次运行摘要追加到 log/run.md\n7. 通过 inbox 通知 main：写入 D:/loopcli/main/inbox/<你的名字>_<时间>.md，简要报告任务结果\n8. 如果没有 pending 任务，输出 \"IDLE\" 并结束本轮\n\"\"\"\n\n\n# ─── 工具函数 ───\n\ndef discover_agents():\n    agents = []\n    for name in os.listdir(LOOPCLI_DIR):\n        path = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, name)\n        marker = os.path.join(path, AGENT_MARKER)\n        if os.path.isdir(path) and os.path.isfile(marker):\n            agents.append({\"name\": name, \"path\": path})\n    return agents\n\n\ndef find_template(template_id):\n    \"\"\"在 subagent 目录下搜索模板文件\"\"\"\n    for dept in os.listdir(SUBAGENT_DIR):\n        dept_dir = os.path.join(SUBAGENT_DIR, dept)\n        if not os.path.isdir(dept_dir):\n            continue\n        candidate = os.path.join(dept_dir, f\"{template_id}.md\")\n        if os.path.isfile(candidate):\n            return candidate\n    return None\n\n\ndef load_agent_state(agent_path):\n    state_file = os.path.join(agent_path, \"memory\", \"state.json\")\n    if os.path.isfile(state_file):\n        with open(state_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            return json.load(f)\n    return None\n\n\ndef load_agent_tasks(agent_path):\n    tasks_file = os.path.join(agent_path, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\")\n    if os.path.isfile(tasks_file):\n        with open(tasks_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            return json.load(f)\n    return []\n\n\n# ─── 子命令: create ───\n\ndef cmd_create(args):\n    template_id = args.template\n    task_desc = args.task or \"\"\n\n    tpl_file = find_template(template_id)\n    if not tpl_file:\n        print(f\"[错误] 找不到模板: {template_id}\")\n        print(\"用 loopcli templates 查看所有可用模板\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    with open(tpl_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        soul_content = f.read()\n\n    agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, template_id)\n    if os.path.exists(agent_dir):\n        print(f\"[跳过] Agent 已存在: {agent_dir}\")\n        if task_desc:\n            cmd_task_inner(template_id, task_desc, \"\")\n        return\n\n    # 创建目录结构\n    os.makedirs(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"results\"), exist_ok=True)\n    os.makedirs(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"log\"), exist_ok=True)\n\n    # AGENT 标记\n    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(\"type: main\\n\")\n\n    # SOUL.md（模板内容）\n    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"SOUL.md\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(soul_content)\n\n    # PROMPT.md\n    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"PROMPT.md\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(DEFAULT_PROMPT)\n\n    # state.json\n    state = {\"agent\": template_id, \"status\": \"idle\", \"current_task\": None, \"last_run\": None, \"run_count\": 0, \"created\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\")}\n    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"state.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(state, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    # tasks.json\n    tasks = []\n    if task_desc:\n        tasks.append({\"id\": 1, \"status\": \"pending\", \"title\": task_desc, \"description\": task_desc, \"created\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"), \"assignee\": template_id})\n    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(tasks, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    # run.md\n    with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"log\", \"run.md\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(\"# 运行日志\\n\\n| 时间 | 状态 | 任务 | 摘要 |\\n|------|------|------|------|\\n\")\n\n    print(f\"[创建成功] {template_id}\")\n    print(f\"  目录: {agent_dir}\")\n    if task_desc:\n        print(f\"  任务: {task_desc}\")\n    print(f\"  下一轮 loopcli 将自动启动该 Agent\")\n\n\n# ─── 子命令: task ───\n\ndef cmd_task_inner(agent_name, title, desc):\n    agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, agent_name)\n    if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n        print(f\"[错误] 不是有效的 Agent: {agent_name}\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    tasks_file = os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\")\n    tasks = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n    next_id = max((t[\"id\"] for t in tasks), default=0) + 1\n    tasks.append({\n        \"id\": next_id,\n        \"status\": \"pending\",\n        \"title\": title,\n        \"description\": desc or title,\n        \"created\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n        \"assignee\": agent_name\n    })\n    with open(tasks_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(tasks, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n    print(f\"[派发成功] {agent_name} <- #{next_id} {title}\")\n\n\ndef cmd_task(args):\n    cmd_task_inner(args.agent, args.title, args.desc)\n\n\n# ─── 子命令: list ───\n\ndef cmd_list(args):\n    agents = discover_agents()\n    if not agents:\n        print(\"没有发现任何 Agent\")\n        return\n    print(f\"{'Agent':<45} {'状态':<10} {'任务数':<8} {'最后运行'}\")\n    print(\"-\" * 85)\n    for a in agents:\n        state = load_agent_state(a[\"path\"]) or {}\n        tasks = load_agent_tasks(a[\"path\"])\n        pending = len([t for t in tasks if t.get(\"status\") == \"pending\"])\n        status = state.get(\"status\", \"?\")\n        last_run = state.get(\"last_run\", \"-\")\n        print(f\"{a['name']:<45} {status:<10} {pending:<8} {last_run}\")\n\n\n# ─── 子命令: templates ───\n\ndef cmd_templates(args):\n    found = []\n    for dept in sorted(os.listdir(SUBAGENT_DIR)):\n        dept_dir = os.path.join(SUBAGENT_DIR, dept)\n        if not os.path.isdir(dept_dir):\n            continue\n        for fname in sorted(os.listdir(dept_dir)):\n            if fname.endswith(\".md\"):\n                found.append(fname[:-3])\n    if args.filter:\n        found = [t for t in found if args.filter.lower() in t.lower()]\n    print(f\"共 {len(found)} 个模板:\")\n    for t in found:\n        print(f\"  {t}\")\n\n\n# ─── 子命令: run（主循环）───\n\ndef handle_event(agent_name, line):\n    line = line.strip()\n    if not line:\n        return\n    try:\n        event = json.loads(line)\n    except json.JSONDecodeError:\n        print(f\"[{agent_name}] {line}\", flush=True)\n        return\n\n    event_type = event.get(\"type\", \"\")\n\n    if event_type == \"assistant\":\n        msg = event.get(\"message\", {})\n        for block in msg.get(\"content\", []):\n            if block.get(\"type\") == \"text\":\n                text = block.get(\"text\", \"\")\n                if text:\n                    print(f\"[{agent_name}] {text}\", flush=True)\n            elif block.get(\"type\") == \"tool_use\":\n                name = block.get(\"name\", \"\")\n                inp = block.get(\"input\", {})\n                detail = \"\"\n                for k in (\"file_path\", \"command\", \"pattern\"):\n                    if k in inp:\n                        detail = inp[k]\n                        break\n                print(f\"[{agent_name}] ● {name}({detail})\", flush=True)\n\n    elif event_type == \"tool_result\":\n        content = event.get(\"content\", \"\")\n        texts = []\n        if isinstance(content, list):\n            texts = [b.get(\"text\", \"\") for b in content if b.get(\"text\")]\n        elif isinstance(content, str):\n            texts = [content]\n        for text in texts:\n            print(f\"[{agent_name}]   ↳ {text[:200]}\", flush=True)\n\n    elif event_type == \"result\":\n        text = event.get(\"result\", \"\")\n        if text:\n            print(f\"[{agent_name}] [结果] {text[:500]}\", flush=True)\n        cost = event.get(\"cost_usd\", \"\")\n        duration = event.get(\"duration_ms\", \"\")\n        if cost or duration:\n            print(f\"[{agent_name}] [统计] 耗时: {duration}ms, 费用: ${cost}\", flush=True)\n\n    elif event_type == \"error\":\n        print(f\"[{agent_name}] [错误] {event.get('error', '')}\", flush=True)\n\n\ndef run_agent(agent, iteration, run_log_dir):\n    name = agent[\"name\"]\n    path = agent[\"path\"]\n    prompt_file = os.path.join(path, \"PROMPT.md\")\n    log_file_path = os.path.join(path, \"log\", \"raw.log\")\n    run_agent_log = os.path.join(run_log_dir, f\"{name}.log\")\n    ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n\n    if not os.path.isfile(prompt_file):\n        print(f\"[{name}] 没有 PROMPT.md，跳过\", flush=True)\n        return\n\n    with open(prompt_file, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        prompt = f.read()\n\n    os.makedirs(os.path.join(path, \"log\"), exist_ok=True)\n    log_file = open(log_file_path, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    agent_log = open(run_agent_log, \"a\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n    header = f\"\\n[{ts}] --- 开始 (第{iteration}轮) ---\\n\"\n    log_file.write(header)\n    agent_log.write(header)\n    log_file.flush()\n    agent_log.flush()\n\n    env = {**os.environ, \"IS_SANDBOX\": \"1\"}\n\n    proc = subprocess.Popen(\n        f'\"{CLAUDE}\" --print --verbose --output-format stream-json --dangerously-skip-permissions',\n        stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\n        stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n        stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n        env=env,\n        shell=True,\n        cwd=path,\n    )\n\n    proc.stdin.write(prompt.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n    proc.stdin.close()\n\n    for line in proc.stdout:\n        decoded = line.decode(\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n        log_file.write(decoded)\n        agent_log.write(decoded)\n        log_file.flush()\n        agent_log.flush()\n        handle_event(name, decoded)\n\n    stderr_output = proc.stderr.read().decode(\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n    if stderr_output:\n        print(f\"[{name}] [STDERR] {stderr_output}\", flush=True)\n        log_file.write(stderr_output)\n        agent_log.write(stderr_output)\n\n    proc.wait()\n\n    footer = f\"\\n[{ts}] --- 结束 (exit={proc.returncode}) ---\\n\"\n    log_file.write(footer)\n    agent_log.write(footer)\n    log_file.close()\n    agent_log.close()\n\n    # 更新 state.json\n    state_file = os.path.join(path, \"memory\", \"state.json\")\n    state = load_agent_state(path) or {}\n    state[\"status\"] = \"idle\"\n    state[\"last_run\"] = ts\n    state[\"run_count\"] = state.get(\"run_count\", 0) + 1\n    with open(state_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(state, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    status = \"完成\" if proc.returncode == 0 else f\"异常(exit={proc.returncode})\"\n    print(f\"[{name}] 本轮{status}\", flush=True)\n\n\ndef git_push():\n    \"\"\"自动 commit 和 push 到 GitHub\"\"\"\n    token_file = GIT_TOKEN_FILE\n    if not os.path.isfile(token_file):\n        return\n    token = open(token_file, \"r\").read().strip()\n    if not token:\n        return\n    try:\n        subprocess.run([\"git\", \"add\", \"-A\"], cwd=LOOPCLI_DIR, capture_output=True, timeout=30)\n        subprocess.run(\n            [\"git\", \"commit\", \"-m\", f\"auto: loopcli sync {datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')}\"],\n            cwd=LOOPCLI_DIR, capture_output=True, timeout=30\n        )\n        url = f\"https://{token}@github.com/zhoudingnuo/loopcli.git\"\n        subprocess.run([\"git\", \"push\", url, \"main\"], cwd=LOOPCLI_DIR, capture_output=True, timeout=60)\n        print(\"[git] 已同步到 GitHub\", flush=True)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"[git] 同步失败: {e}\", flush=True)\n\n\ndef cmd_run(args):\n    agents = discover_agents()\n    if not agents:\n        print(\"未发现任何 Agent（需要目录下有 AGENT 标记文件）\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    # 创建本次运行日志目录\n    run_id = datetime.now().strftime(\"run_%Y%m%d_%H%M%S\")\n    run_log_dir = os.path.join(LOGS_DIR, run_id)\n    os.makedirs(run_log_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n    # 写入运行元信息\n    meta = {\n        \"run_id\": run_id,\n        \"started\": datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"),\n        \"iterations\": args.iterations or \"无限\",\n        \"agents\": [a[\"name\"] for a in agents],\n    }\n    with open(os.path.join(run_log_dir, \"meta.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(meta, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    print(f\"运行 ID: {run_id}\")\n    print(f\"日志目录: {run_log_dir}\")\n    print(f\"发现 {len(agents)} 个 Agent: {', '.join(a['name'] for a in agents)}\")\n\n    count = 0\n    while args.iterations == 0 or count < args.iterations:\n        count += 1\n        # 每轮重新扫描（可能有新 Agent）\n        agents = discover_agents()\n        ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n        print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n        print(f\"[{ts}] 第 {count}{'/' + str(args.iterations) if args.iterations else ''} 轮 | {len(agents)} 个 Agent\")\n        print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n\n        threads = []\n        for agent in agents:\n            print(f\"\\n--- 启动 [{agent['name']}] ---\", flush=True)\n            t = threading.Thread(target=run_agent, args=(agent, count, run_log_dir))\n            t.start()\n            threads.append(t)\n        for t in threads:\n            t.join()\n\n        # 每轮结束后同步到 GitHub\n        git_push()\n\n        # 等待下一轮\n        if args.iterations == 0 or count < args.iterations:\n            print(f\"\\n等待 {args.wait} 秒后进入下一轮...\", flush=True)\n            time.sleep(args.wait)\n    meta[\"finished\"] = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    meta[\"total_iterations\"] = count\n    with open(os.path.join(run_log_dir, \"meta.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(meta, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    print(f\"\\n运行结束，日志保存在: {run_log_dir}\")\n\n\n# ─── CLI 入口 ───\n\nparser = argparse.ArgumentParser(description=\"LoopCLI — 多 Agent 自治系统\")\nsub = parser.add_subparsers(dest=\"command\")\n\n# loopcli run [-n N]\np_run = sub.add_parser(\"run\", help=\"启动 Agent 循环（默认）\")\np_run.add_argument(\"-n\", \"--iterations\", type=int, default=0, help=\"迭代次数，0=无限\")\np_run.add_argument(\"-w\", \"--wait\", type=int, default=10, help=\"每轮间隔秒数（默认 10）\")\n\n# loopcli create <template> [--task TASK]\np_create = sub.add_parser(\"create\", help=\"从模板创建新 Agent\")\np_create.add_argument(\"template\", help=\"模板 ID，如 engineering-frontend-developer\")\np_create.add_argument(\"--task\", \"-t\", help=\"初始任务描述\")\n\n# loopcli task <agent> <title> [--desc DESC]\np_task = sub.add_parser(\"task\", help=\"给 Agent 派发任务\")\np_task.add_argument(\"agent\", help=\"Agent 目录名\")\np_task.add_argument(\"title\", help=\"任务标题\")\np_task.add_argument(\"--desc\", \"-d\", default=\"\", help=\"任务描述\")\n\n# loopcli list\nsub.add_parser(\"list\", help=\"列出所有 Agent 及状态\")\n\n# loopcli templates [--filter X]\np_tpl = sub.add_parser(\"templates\", help=\"列出可用模板\")\np_tpl.add_argument(\"--filter\", \"-f\", default=\"\", help=\"按关键词筛选\")\n\n# loopcli msg <内容> [--agent AGENT]\np_msg = sub.add_parser(\"msg\", help=\"给 Agent 发消息\")\np_msg.add_argument(\"content\", help=\"消息内容\")\np_msg.add_argument(\"--agent\", \"-a\", default=\"main\", help=\"目标 Agent（默认 main）\")\n\n# 预处理：把裸数字参数（如 -n 5）转为 run 子命令\ndef cmd_msg(args):\n    agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, args.agent)\n    inbox = os.path.join(agent_dir, \"inbox\")\n    if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n        print(f\"[错误] 不是有效的 Agent: {args.agent}\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n    os.makedirs(inbox, exist_ok=True)\n    ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y%m%d_%H%M\")\n    msg_file = os.path.join(inbox, f\"user_{ts}.md\")\n    with open(msg_file, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        f.write(f\"# 来自 zhoudingnuo 的消息\\n- 类型：指令\\n- 时间：{datetime.now().strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M')}\\n\\n## 内容\\n{args.content}\\n\")\n    print(f\"[已发送] -> {args.agent}/inbox/  {args.content}\")\n\n\n# 预处理：把裸数字参数（如 -n 5）转为 run 子命令\nif sys.argv[1:] and sys.argv[1] not in (\"run\", \"create\", \"task\", \"list\", \"templates\", \"msg\", \"-h\", \"--help\"):\n    sys.argv.insert(1, \"run\")\n\nargs = parser.parse_args()\n\nif args.command == \"create\":\n    cmd_create(args)\nelif args.command == \"task\":\n    cmd_task(args)\nelif args.command == \"list\":\n    cmd_list(args)\nelif args.command == \"templates\":\n    cmd_templates(args)\nelif args.command == \"msg\":\n    cmd_msg(args)\nelse:\n    # run 或无子命令\n    if not hasattr(args, \"iterations\"):\n        args.iterations = 0\n    cmd_run(args)\n","numLines":477,"startLine":1,"totalLines":477}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_9a268772e6c448a2933fff12","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 列出 Agent\n2\t\n3\t查看所有已注册 Agent 及其状态。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```bash\n7\tloopcli list\n8\t```\n9\t\n10\t## 输出\n11\t列出每个 Agent 的名称、状态、任务数、最后运行时间。\n12\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"ab191c8d-b93e-4947-824e-b65176308c32","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.916Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\list-agents.md","content":"# Skill: 列出 Agent\n\n查看所有已注册 Agent 及其状态。\n\n## 用法\n```bash\nloopcli list\n```\n\n## 输出\n列出每个 Agent 的名称、状态、任务数、最后运行时间。\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1,"totalLines":12}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_9ab620ffcca2456993346c1a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 发送消息\n2\t\n3\t向其他 Agent 的收件箱发送消息。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```\n7\t写入目标 Agent 的 inbox 目录：\n8\tD:\\loopcli\\<目标agent名>\\inbox\\<自己的名字>_<时间戳>.md\n9\t```\n10\t\n11\t## 文件格式\n12\t```markdown\n13\t# 来自 <你的名字>\n14\t- 类型：任务完成 / 通知 / 错误报告\n15\t- 内容：具体信息\n16\t```\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"5c2f2d35-54f1-4793-a7db-54349bdf8880","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.917Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\outbox.md","content":"# Skill: 发送消息\n\n向其他 Agent 的收件箱发送消息。\n\n## 用法\n```\n写入目标 Agent 的 inbox 目录：\nD:\\loopcli\\<目标agent名>\\inbox\\<自己的名字>_<时间戳>.md\n```\n\n## 文件格式\n```markdown\n# 来自 <你的名字>\n- 类型：任务完成 / 通知 / 错误报告\n- 内容：具体信息\n```\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_25a33214169541288596851a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 派发任务\n2\t\n3\t给已有 Agent 添加新任务。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```bash\n7\tloopcli task <agent目录名> \"任务标题\" --desc \"任务描述\"\n8\t```\n9\t\n10\t## 执行逻辑\n11\t1. 找到 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>/memory/tasks.json\n12\t2. 追加新任务：{ id: 自增, status: \"pending\", title, description, created, assignee }\n13\t3. 写回 tasks.json\n14\t\n15\t## 示例\n16\t```bash\n17\tloopcli task engineering-frontend-developer \"优化首页加载\" --desc \"Lighthouse 60分 → 90+\"\n18\tloopcli task main \"部署到生产环境\" --desc \"合并 staging 分支并部署\"\n19\t```\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"2c24a272-b007-40b7-9e25-2f413cf2fa84","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.917Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\assign-task.md","content":"# Skill: 派发任务\n\n给已有 Agent 添加新任务。\n\n## 用法\n```bash\nloopcli task <agent目录名> \"任务标题\" --desc \"任务描述\"\n```\n\n## 执行逻辑\n1. 找到 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>/memory/tasks.json\n2. 追加新任务：{ id: 自增, status: \"pending\", title, description, created, assignee }\n3. 写回 tasks.json\n\n## 示例\n```bash\nloopcli task engineering-frontend-developer \"优化首页加载\" --desc \"Lighthouse 60分 → 90+\"\nloopcli task main \"部署到生产环境\" --desc \"合并 staging 分支并部署\"\n```\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_30be412e28dd43a2a3db6523","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"\n2\tLoopCLI WebUI Backend Server\n3\tREST API + static file hosting for the Agent control console.\n4\t\"\"\"\n5\t\n6\timport json\n7\timport os\n8\timport signal\n9\timport subprocess\n10\timport sys\n11\timport time\n12\timport threading\n13\tfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\n14\tfrom http.server import HTTPServer, SimpleHTTPRequestHandler\n15\tfrom socketserver import ThreadingMixIn\n16\tfrom pathlib import Path\n17\tfrom urllib.parse import urlparse, parse_qs\n18\t\n19\tLOOPCLI_ROOT = Path(r\"D:\\loopcli\")\n20\tWEBUI_DIR = Path(__file__).parent.resolve()\n21\tMAIN_DIR = LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\"\n22\tLOOP_STATE_FILE = WEBUI_DIR / \"loop_state.json\"\n23\t\n24\t_loop_proc = None\n25\t_loop_lock = threading.Lock()\n26\t\n27\t\n28\tdef read_json(path: Path, default=None):\n29\t    if not path.exists():\n30\t        return default if default is not None else {}\n31\t    try:\n32\t        return json.loads(path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n33\t    except (json.JSONDecodeError, OSError):\n34\t        return default if default is not None else {}\n35\t\n36\t\n37\tdef write_json(path: Path, data):\n38\t    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n39\t    path.write_text(json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n40\t\n41\t\n42\tdef scan_agents():\n43\t    \"\"\"Scan loopcli root for agent directories (containing AGENT marker file).\"\"\"\n44\t    agents = []\n45\t    for child in LOOPCLI_ROOT.iterdir():\n46\t        if not child.is_dir():\n47\t            continue\n48\t        agent_marker = child / \"AGENT\"\n49\t        if not agent_marker.exists():\n50\t            continue\n51\t        state = read_json(child / \"memory\" / \"state.json\", {})\n52\t        soul_path = child / \"SOUL.md\"\n53\t        desc = \"\"\n54\t        if soul_path.exists():\n55\t            lines = soul_path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").strip().splitlines()\n56\t            for line in lines:\n57\t                stripped = line.strip()\n58\t                if stripped and not stripped.startswith(\"#\"):\n59\t                    desc = stripped\n60\t                    break\n61\t        agents.append({\n62\t            \"id\": child.name,\n63\t            \"name\": state.get(\"agent\", child.name),\n64\t            \"status\": state.get(\"status\", \"unknown\"),\n65\t            \"description\": desc,\n66\t            \"last_run\": state.get(\"last_run\"),\n67\t            \"run_count\": state.get(\"run_count\", 0),\n68\t            \"current_task\": state.get(\"current_task\"),\n69\t        })\n70\t    return agents\n71\t\n72\t\n73\tdef get_main_tasks():\n74\t    return read_json(MAIN_DIR / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\", [])\n75\t\n76\t\n77\tdef get_recent_lines(filepath: Path, n=100):\n78\t    if not filepath.exists():\n79\t        return []\n80\t    try:\n81\t        with open(filepath, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\") as f:\n82\t            lines = f.readlines()\n83\t        return [l.rstrip(\"\\n\\r\") for l in lines[-n:]]\n84\t    except OSError:\n85\t        return []\n86\t\n87\t\n88\t# --- Loop Process Management ---\n89\t\n90\tdef get_loop_state():\n91\t    return read_json(LOOP_STATE_FILE, {\n92\t        \"status\": \"stopped\", \"pid\": None,\n93\t        \"started_at\": None, \"iterations\": 0, \"total_iterations\": 0,\n94\t    })\n95\t\n96\t\n97\tdef set_loop_state(state):\n98\t    write_json(LOOP_STATE_FILE, state)\n99\t\n100\t\n101\tdef _is_pid_alive(pid):\n102\t    if not pid:\n103\t        return False\n104\t    try:\n105\t        os.kill(pid, 0)\n106\t        return True\n107\t    except (ProcessLookupError, PermissionError, OSError):\n108\t        return False\n109\t\n110\t\n111\tdef _monitor_loopcli(proc):\n112\t    proc.wait()\n113\t    with _loop_lock:\n114\t        state = get_loop_state()\n115\t        if state.get(\"pid\") == proc.pid:\n116\t            state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n117\t            state[\"pid\"] = None\n118\t            state[\"ended_at\"] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n119\t            set_loop_state(state)\n120\t\n121\t\n122\tdef start_loopcli_process(iterations=0):\n123\t    global _loop_proc\n124\t    with _loop_lock:\n125\t        state = get_loop_state()\n126\t        if state.get(\"status\") == \"running\" and _is_pid_alive(state.get(\"pid\")):\n127\t            return {\"error\": \"Already running\"}, 409\n128\t\n129\t        cmd = [sys.executable, str(LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"run.py\"), \"run\"]\n130\t        if iterations > 0:\n131\t            cmd.extend([\"-n\", str(iterations)])\n132\t\n133\t        proc = subprocess.Popen(\n134\t            cmd,\n135\t            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n136\t            stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n137\t            creationflags=getattr(subprocess, \"CREATE_NO_WINDOW\", 0),\n138\t        )\n139\t        _loop_proc = proc\n140\t\n141\t        state = {\n142\t            \"status\": \"running\",\n143\t            \"pid\": proc.pid,\n144\t            \"started_at\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n145\t            \"iterations\": iterations,\n146\t            \"total_iterations\": 0,\n147\t        }\n148\t        set_loop_state(state)\n149\t\n150\t        t = threading.Thread(target=_monitor_loopcli, args=(proc,), daemon=True)\n151\t        t.start()\n152\t        return state, 200\n153\t\n154\t\n155\tdef stop_loopcli_process():\n156\t    global _loop_proc\n157\t    with _loop_lock:\n158\t        state = get_loop_state()\n159\t        pid = state.get(\"pid\")\n160\t        if not pid or not _is_pid_alive(pid):\n161\t            state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n162\t            state[\"pid\"] = None\n163\t            set_loop_state(state)\n164\t            return {\"error\": \"Not running\"}, 409\n165\t\n166\t        try:\n167\t            os.kill(pid, signal.SIGTERM)\n168\t        except OSError:\n169\t            pass\n170\t        if _loop_proc and _loop_proc.pid == pid:\n171\t            try:\n172\t                _loop_proc.terminate()\n173\t            except OSError:\n174\t                pass\n175\t            _loop_proc = None\n176\t\n177\t        state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n178\t        state[\"pid\"] = None\n179\t        state[\"ended_at\"] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n180\t        set_loop_state(state)\n181\t        return {\"status\": \"stopped\"}, 200\n182\t\n183\t\n184\tclass WebUIHandler(SimpleHTTPRequestHandler):\n185\t    def __init__(self, *args, **kwargs):\n186\t        super().__init__(*args, directory=str(WEBUI_DIR), **kwargs)\n187\t\n188\t    def log_message(self, format, *args):\n189\t        ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\")\n190\t        sys.stdout.write(f\"[{ts}] {format % args}\\n\")\n191\t        sys.stdout.flush()\n192\t\n193\t    def _send_json(self, data, status=200):\n194\t        body = json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2).encode(\"utf-8\")\n195\t        self.send_response(status)\n196\t        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json; charset=utf-8\")\n197\t        self.send_header(\"Content-Length\", str(len(body)))\n198\t        self.end_headers()\n199\t        self.wfile.write(body)\n200\t\n201\t    def _read_body(self):\n202\t        length = int(self.headers.get(\"Content-Length\", 0))\n203\t        if length == 0:\n204\t            return {}\n205\t        raw = self.rfile.read(length)\n206\t        try:\n207\t            return json.loads(raw.decode(\"utf-8\"))\n208\t        except (json.JSONDecodeError, UnicodeDecodeError):\n209\t            return {}\n210\t\n211\t    def _cors_headers(self):\n212\t        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n213\t        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\", \"GET, POST, OPTIONS\")\n214\t        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\", \"Content-Type\")\n215\t\n216\t    # ---------- SSE helpers ----------\n217\t\n218\t    def _send_sse_event(self, data):\n219\t        payload = f\"data: {json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False)}\\n\\n\"\n220\t        self.wfile.write(payload.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n221\t        self.wfile.flush()\n222\t\n223\t    def _handle_sse_logs(self):\n224\t        params = parse_qs(urlparse(self.path).query)\n225\t        agent_id = params.get(\"agent\", [None])[0]\n226\t        if agent_id:\n227\t            log_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n228\t        else:\n229\t            log_path = MAIN_DIR / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n230\t\n231\t        self.send_response(200)\n232\t        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"text/event-stream\")\n233\t        self.send_header(\"Cache-Control\", \"no-cache\")\n234\t        self.send_header(\"Connection\", \"keep-alive\")\n235\t        self.send_header(\"X-Accel-Buffering\", \"no\")\n236\t        self._cors_headers()\n237\t        self.end_headers()\n238\t\n239\t        last_size = 0\n240\t        try:\n241\t            while True:\n242\t                if log_path.exists():\n243\t                    current_size = log_path.stat().st_size\n244\t                    if current_size != last_size:\n245\t                        lines = get_recent_lines(log_path, 500)\n246\t                        self._send_sse_event({\n247\t                            \"agent\": agent_id,\n248\t                            \"lines\": lines,\n249\t                            \"ts\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n250\t                        })\n251\t                        last_size = current_size\n252\t                else:\n253\t                    if last_size != -1:\n254\t                        self._send_sse_event({\"agent\": agent_id, \"lines\": [], \"ts\": datetime.now().isoformat()})\n255\t                        last_size = -1\n256\t                time.sleep(1)\n257\t        except (BrokenPipeError, ConnectionResetError, OSError):\n258\t            pass\n259\t\n260\t    # ---------- GET routes ----------\n261\t\n262\t    def do_GET(self):\n263\t        parsed = urlparse(self.path)\n264\t        path = parsed.path\n265\t\n266\t        if path == \"/api/agents\":\n267\t            return self._send_json(scan_agents())\n268\t\n269\t        if path == \"/api/tasks\":\n270\t            return self._send_json(get_main_tasks())\n271\t\n272\t        if path == \"/api/logs\":\n273\t            params = parse_qs(parsed.query)\n274\t            n = int(params.get(\"n\", [\"100\"])[0])\n275\t            agent_id = params.get(\"agent\", [None])[0]\n276\t            if agent_id:\n277\t                log_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n278\t            else:\n279\t                log_path = MAIN_DIR / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n280\t            lines = get_recent_lines(log_path, n)\n281\t            return self._send_json({\"agent\": agent_id, \"lines\": lines})\n282\t\n283\t        if path == \"/api/logs/stream\":\n284\t            return self._handle_sse_logs()\n285\t\n286\t        if path == \"/api/loopcli/status\":\n287\t            return self._handle_loopcli_status()\n288\t\n289\t        # Static files\n290\t        super().do_GET()\n291\t\n292\t    # ---------- POST routes ----------\n293\t\n294\t    def do_POST(self):\n295\t        parsed = urlparse(self.path)\n296\t        path = parsed.path\n297\t\n298\t        if path == \"/api/tasks\":\n299\t            return self._handle_create_task()\n300\t        if path == \"/api/agents/start\":\n301\t            return self._handle_agent_start()\n302\t        if path == \"/api/loopcli/start\":\n303\t            return self._handle_loopcli_start()\n304\t        if path == \"/api/loopcli/stop\":\n305\t            return self._handle_loopcli_stop()\n306\t        if path == \"/api/loopcli/restart\":\n307\t            return self._handle_loopcli_restart()\n308\t        if path == \"/api/loopcli/dispatch\":\n309\t            return self._handle_loopcli_dispatch()\n310\t\n311\t        self._send_json({\"error\": \"Not found\"}, status=404)\n312\t\n313\t    # ---------- OPTIONS (CORS preflight) ----------\n314\t\n315\t    def do_OPTIONS(self):\n316\t        self.send_response(204)\n317\t        self._cors_headers()\n318\t        self.end_headers()\n319\t\n320\t    # ---------- Handlers ----------\n321\t\n322\t    def _handle_create_task(self):\n323\t        body = self._read_body()\n324\t        title = body.get(\"title\", \"\").strip()\n325\t        if not title:\n326\t            return self._send_json({\"error\": \"title is required\"}, status=400)\n327\t\n328\t        tasks = get_main_tasks()\n329\t        new_id = max((t.get(\"id\", 0) for t in tasks), default=0) + 1\n330\t        task = {\n331\t            \"id\": new_id,\n332\t            \"status\": \"pending\",\n333\t            \"title\": title,\n334\t            \"description\": body.get(\"description\", \"\"),\n335\t            \"created\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n336\t            \"assignee\": body.get(\"assignee\") or \"main\",\n337\t        }\n338\t        tasks.append(task)\n339\t        write_json(MAIN_DIR / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\", tasks)\n340\t        self._send_json(task, status=201)\n341\t\n342\t    def _handle_agent_start(self):\n343\t        body = self._read_body()\n344\t        agent_id = body.get(\"agent\", \"\").strip()\n345\t        if not agent_id:\n346\t            return self._send_json({\"error\": \"agent is required\"}, status=400)\n347\t\n348\t        agent_dir = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id\n349\t        prompt_file = agent_dir / \"PROMPT.md\"\n350\t        if not prompt_file.exists():\n351\t            return self._send_json({\"error\": f\"Agent '{agent_id}' not found or no PROMPT.md\"}, status=404)\n352\t\n353\t        # Launch claude in the agent directory, reading PROMPT.md\n354\t        try:\n355\t            proc = subprocess.Popen(\n356\t                [\"claude\", \"--print\", \"$(cat PROMPT.md)\"],\n357\t                cwd=str(agent_dir),\n358\t                shell=True,\n359\t                stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n360\t                stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n361\t            )\n362\t        except FileNotFoundError:\n363\t            proc = subprocess.Popen(\n364\t                [\"claude\", \"--print\", prompt_file.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")],\n365\t                cwd=str(agent_dir),\n366\t                stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n367\t                stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n368\t            )\n369\t\n370\t        self._send_json({\n371\t            \"agent\": agent_id,\n372\t            \"pid\": proc.pid,\n373\t            \"status\": \"started\",\n374\t        })\n375\t\n376\t    # --- Loop control handlers ---\n377\t\n378\t    def _handle_loopcli_status(self):\n379\t        state = get_loop_state()\n380\t        pid = state.get(\"pid\")\n381\t        if state.get(\"status\") == \"running\" and pid and not _is_pid_alive(pid):\n382\t            state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n383\t            state[\"pid\"] = None\n384\t            state[\"ended_at\"] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n385\t            set_loop_state(state)\n386\t\n387\t        uptime = 0\n388\t        if state.get(\"started_at\"):\n389\t            try:\n390\t                started = datetime.fromisoformat(state[\"started_at\"])\n391\t                uptime = int((datetime.now() - started).total_seconds())\n392\t            except (ValueError, TypeError):\n393\t                pass\n394\t        state[\"uptime_seconds\"] = uptime\n395\t        self._send_json(state)\n396\t\n397\t    def _handle_loopcli_start(self):\n398\t        body = self._read_body()\n399\t        iterations = int(body.get(\"iterations\", 0))\n400\t        data, status = start_loopcli_process(iterations)\n401\t        self._send_json(data, status)\n402\t\n403\t    def _handle_loopcli_stop(self):\n404\t        data, status = stop_loopcli_process()\n405\t        self._send_json(data, status)\n406\t\n407\t    def _handle_loopcli_restart(self):\n408\t        stop_loopcli_process()\n409\t        time.sleep(0.5)\n410\t        body = self._read_body()\n411\t        iterations = int(body.get(\"iterations\", 0))\n412\t        data, status = start_loopcli_process(iterations)\n413\t        self._send_json(data, status)\n414\t\n415\t    def _handle_loopcli_dispatch(self):\n416\t        body = self._read_body()\n417\t        agent_id = body.get(\"agent\", \"\").strip()\n418\t        title = body.get(\"title\", \"\").strip()\n419\t        if not agent_id or not title:\n420\t            return self._send_json({\"error\": \"agent and title are required\"}, status=400)\n421\t\n422\t        agent_dir = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id\n423\t        if not (agent_dir / \"AGENT\").exists():\n424\t            return self._send_json({\"error\": f\"Agent '{agent_id}' not found\"}, status=404)\n425\t\n426\t        # Write task to agent's tasks.json\n427\t        tasks_file = agent_dir / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\"\n428\t        tasks = read_json(tasks_file, [])\n429\t        new_id = max((t.get(\"id\", 0) for t in tasks), default=0) + 1\n430\t        task = {\n431\t            \"id\": new_id,\n432\t            \"status\": \"pending\",\n433\t            \"title\": title,\n434\t            \"description\": body.get(\"description\", \"\"),\n435\t            \"created\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n436\t            \"assignee\": agent_id,\n437\t        }\n438\t        tasks.append(task)\n439\t        write_json(tasks_file, tasks)\n440\t\n441\t        # Start claude process for this agent\n442\t        prompt_file = agent_dir / \"PROMPT.md\"\n443\t        prompt = \"\"\n444\t        if prompt_file.exists():\n445\t            prompt = prompt_file.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n446\t\n447\t        proc = subprocess.Popen(\n448\t            [\"claude\", \"--print\", \"--dangerously-skip-permissions\"],\n449\t            stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\n450\t            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n451\t            stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n452\t            cwd=str(agent_dir),\n453\t        )\n454\t        if prompt:\n455\t            proc.stdin.write(prompt.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n456\t            proc.stdin.close()\n457\t\n458\t        self._send_json({\n459\t            \"task\": task,\n460\t            \"pid\": proc.pid,\n461\t            \"status\": \"dispatched\",\n462\t        }, status=201)\n463\t\n464\t\n465\tclass ThreadedHTTPServer(ThreadingMixIn, HTTPServer):\n466\t    daemon_threads = True\n467\t\n468\t\n469\tdef main():\n470\t    host = \"0.0.0.0\"\n471\t    port = 8080\n472\t    server = ThreadedHTTPServer((host, port), WebUIHandler)\n473\t    print(f\"LoopCLI WebUI Server running on http://{host}:{port}\")\n474\t    print(f\"Static files served from: {WEBUI_DIR}\")\n475\t    print(f\"Agent root: {LOOPCLI_ROOT}\")\n476\t    print(\"Press Ctrl+C to stop.\")\n477\t    try:\n478\t        server.serve_forever()\n479\t    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n480\t        print(\"\\nShutting down.\")\n481\t        server.server_close()\n482\t\n483\t\n484\tif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n485\t    main()\n486\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ffbd59c5-8d5d-4d16-915f-1cf1f494f8cd","uuid":"1230a85f-04c9-4091-a75f-49f4235ca7ad","timestamp":"2026-05-20T22:35:09.918Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\main\\webui\\server.py","content":"\"\"\"\nLoopCLI WebUI Backend Server\nREST API + static file hosting for the Agent control console.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport signal\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport time\nimport threading\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\nfrom http.server import HTTPServer, SimpleHTTPRequestHandler\nfrom socketserver import ThreadingMixIn\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom urllib.parse import urlparse, parse_qs\n\nLOOPCLI_ROOT = Path(r\"D:\\loopcli\")\nWEBUI_DIR = Path(__file__).parent.resolve()\nMAIN_DIR = LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\"\nLOOP_STATE_FILE = WEBUI_DIR / \"loop_state.json\"\n\n_loop_proc = None\n_loop_lock = threading.Lock()\n\n\ndef read_json(path: Path, default=None):\n    if not path.exists():\n        return default if default is not None else {}\n    try:\n        return json.loads(path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\"))\n    except (json.JSONDecodeError, OSError):\n        return default if default is not None else {}\n\n\ndef write_json(path: Path, data):\n    path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    path.write_text(json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n\ndef scan_agents():\n    \"\"\"Scan loopcli root for agent directories (containing AGENT marker file).\"\"\"\n    agents = []\n    for child in LOOPCLI_ROOT.iterdir():\n        if not child.is_dir():\n            continue\n        agent_marker = child / \"AGENT\"\n        if not agent_marker.exists():\n            continue\n        state = read_json(child / \"memory\" / \"state.json\", {})\n        soul_path = child / \"SOUL.md\"\n        desc = \"\"\n        if soul_path.exists():\n            lines = soul_path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\").strip().splitlines()\n            for line in lines:\n                stripped = line.strip()\n                if stripped and not stripped.startswith(\"#\"):\n                    desc = stripped\n                    break\n        agents.append({\n            \"id\": child.name,\n            \"name\": state.get(\"agent\", child.name),\n            \"status\": state.get(\"status\", \"unknown\"),\n            \"description\": desc,\n            \"last_run\": state.get(\"last_run\"),\n            \"run_count\": state.get(\"run_count\", 0),\n            \"current_task\": state.get(\"current_task\"),\n        })\n    return agents\n\n\ndef get_main_tasks():\n    return read_json(MAIN_DIR / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\", [])\n\n\ndef get_recent_lines(filepath: Path, n=100):\n    if not filepath.exists():\n        return []\n    try:\n        with open(filepath, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\") as f:\n            lines = f.readlines()\n        return [l.rstrip(\"\\n\\r\") for l in lines[-n:]]\n    except OSError:\n        return []\n\n\n# --- Loop Process Management ---\n\ndef get_loop_state():\n    return read_json(LOOP_STATE_FILE, {\n        \"status\": \"stopped\", \"pid\": None,\n        \"started_at\": None, \"iterations\": 0, \"total_iterations\": 0,\n    })\n\n\ndef set_loop_state(state):\n    write_json(LOOP_STATE_FILE, state)\n\n\ndef _is_pid_alive(pid):\n    if not pid:\n        return False\n    try:\n        os.kill(pid, 0)\n        return True\n    except (ProcessLookupError, PermissionError, OSError):\n        return False\n\n\ndef _monitor_loopcli(proc):\n    proc.wait()\n    with _loop_lock:\n        state = get_loop_state()\n        if state.get(\"pid\") == proc.pid:\n            state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n            state[\"pid\"] = None\n            state[\"ended_at\"] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n            set_loop_state(state)\n\n\ndef start_loopcli_process(iterations=0):\n    global _loop_proc\n    with _loop_lock:\n        state = get_loop_state()\n        if state.get(\"status\") == \"running\" and _is_pid_alive(state.get(\"pid\")):\n            return {\"error\": \"Already running\"}, 409\n\n        cmd = [sys.executable, str(LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"run.py\"), \"run\"]\n        if iterations > 0:\n            cmd.extend([\"-n\", str(iterations)])\n\n        proc = subprocess.Popen(\n            cmd,\n            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n            stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n            creationflags=getattr(subprocess, \"CREATE_NO_WINDOW\", 0),\n        )\n        _loop_proc = proc\n\n        state = {\n            \"status\": \"running\",\n            \"pid\": proc.pid,\n            \"started_at\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n            \"iterations\": iterations,\n            \"total_iterations\": 0,\n        }\n        set_loop_state(state)\n\n        t = threading.Thread(target=_monitor_loopcli, args=(proc,), daemon=True)\n        t.start()\n        return state, 200\n\n\ndef stop_loopcli_process():\n    global _loop_proc\n    with _loop_lock:\n        state = get_loop_state()\n        pid = state.get(\"pid\")\n        if not pid or not _is_pid_alive(pid):\n            state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n            state[\"pid\"] = None\n            set_loop_state(state)\n            return {\"error\": \"Not running\"}, 409\n\n        try:\n            os.kill(pid, signal.SIGTERM)\n        except OSError:\n            pass\n        if _loop_proc and _loop_proc.pid == pid:\n            try:\n                _loop_proc.terminate()\n            except OSError:\n                pass\n            _loop_proc = None\n\n        state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n        state[\"pid\"] = None\n        state[\"ended_at\"] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n        set_loop_state(state)\n        return {\"status\": \"stopped\"}, 200\n\n\nclass WebUIHandler(SimpleHTTPRequestHandler):\n    def __init__(self, *args, **kwargs):\n        super().__init__(*args, directory=str(WEBUI_DIR), **kwargs)\n\n    def log_message(self, format, *args):\n        ts = datetime.now().strftime(\"%H:%M:%S\")\n        sys.stdout.write(f\"[{ts}] {format % args}\\n\")\n        sys.stdout.flush()\n\n    def _send_json(self, data, status=200):\n        body = json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2).encode(\"utf-8\")\n        self.send_response(status)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json; charset=utf-8\")\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Length\", str(len(body)))\n        self.end_headers()\n        self.wfile.write(body)\n\n    def _read_body(self):\n        length = int(self.headers.get(\"Content-Length\", 0))\n        if length == 0:\n            return {}\n        raw = self.rfile.read(length)\n        try:\n            return json.loads(raw.decode(\"utf-8\"))\n        except (json.JSONDecodeError, UnicodeDecodeError):\n            return {}\n\n    def _cors_headers(self):\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\", \"*\")\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Methods\", \"GET, POST, OPTIONS\")\n        self.send_header(\"Access-Control-Allow-Headers\", \"Content-Type\")\n\n    # ---------- SSE helpers ----------\n\n    def _send_sse_event(self, data):\n        payload = f\"data: {json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False)}\\n\\n\"\n        self.wfile.write(payload.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n        self.wfile.flush()\n\n    def _handle_sse_logs(self):\n        params = parse_qs(urlparse(self.path).query)\n        agent_id = params.get(\"agent\", [None])[0]\n        if agent_id:\n            log_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n        else:\n            log_path = MAIN_DIR / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n\n        self.send_response(200)\n        self.send_header(\"Content-Type\", \"text/event-stream\")\n        self.send_header(\"Cache-Control\", \"no-cache\")\n        self.send_header(\"Connection\", \"keep-alive\")\n        self.send_header(\"X-Accel-Buffering\", \"no\")\n        self._cors_headers()\n        self.end_headers()\n\n        last_size = 0\n        try:\n            while True:\n                if log_path.exists():\n                    current_size = log_path.stat().st_size\n                    if current_size != last_size:\n                        lines = get_recent_lines(log_path, 500)\n                        self._send_sse_event({\n                            \"agent\": agent_id,\n                            \"lines\": lines,\n                            \"ts\": datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                        })\n                        last_size = current_size\n                else:\n                    if last_size != -1:\n                        self._send_sse_event({\"agent\": agent_id, \"lines\": [], \"ts\": datetime.now().isoformat()})\n                        last_size = -1\n                time.sleep(1)\n        except (BrokenPipeError, ConnectionResetError, OSError):\n            pass\n\n    # ---------- GET routes ----------\n\n    def do_GET(self):\n        parsed = urlparse(self.path)\n        path = parsed.path\n\n        if path == \"/api/agents\":\n            return self._send_json(scan_agents())\n\n        if path == \"/api/tasks\":\n            return self._send_json(get_main_tasks())\n\n        if path == \"/api/logs\":\n            params = parse_qs(parsed.query)\n            n = int(params.get(\"n\", [\"100\"])[0])\n            agent_id = params.get(\"agent\", [None])[0]\n            if agent_id:\n                log_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n            else:\n                log_path = MAIN_DIR / \"log\" / \"run.md\"\n            lines = get_recent_lines(log_path, n)\n            return self._send_json({\"agent\": agent_id, \"lines\": lines})\n\n        if path == \"/api/logs/stream\":\n            return self._handle_sse_logs()\n\n        if path == \"/api/loopcli/status\":\n            return self._handle_loopcli_status()\n\n        # Static files\n        super().do_GET()\n\n    # ---------- POST routes ----------\n\n    def do_POST(self):\n        parsed = urlparse(self.path)\n        path = parsed.path\n\n        if path == \"/api/tasks\":\n            return self._handle_create_task()\n        if path == \"/api/agents/start\":\n            return self._handle_agent_start()\n        if path == \"/api/loopcli/start\":\n            return self._handle_loopcli_start()\n        if path == \"/api/loopcli/stop\":\n            return self._handle_loopcli_stop()\n        if path == \"/api/loopcli/restart\":\n            return self._handle_loopcli_restart()\n        if path == \"/api/loopcli/dispatch\":\n            return self._handle_loopcli_dispatch()\n\n        self._send_json({\"error\": \"Not found\"}, status=404)\n\n    # ---------- OPTIONS (CORS preflight) ----------\n\n    def do_OPTIONS(self):\n        self.send_response(204)\n        self._cors_headers()\n        self.end_headers()\n\n    # ---------- Handlers ----------\n\n    def _handle_create_task(self):\n        body = self._read_body()\n        title = body.get(\"title\", \"\").strip()\n        if not title:\n            return self._send_json({\"error\": \"title is required\"}, status=400)\n\n        tasks = get_main_tasks()\n        new_id = max((t.get(\"id\", 0) for t in tasks), default=0) + 1\n        task = {\n            \"id\": new_id,\n            \"status\": \"pending\",\n            \"title\": title,\n            \"description\": body.get(\"description\", \"\"),\n            \"created\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n            \"assignee\": body.get(\"assignee\") or \"main\",\n        }\n        tasks.append(task)\n        write_json(MAIN_DIR / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\", tasks)\n        self._send_json(task, status=201)\n\n    def _handle_agent_start(self):\n        body = self._read_body()\n        agent_id = body.get(\"agent\", \"\").strip()\n        if not agent_id:\n            return self._send_json({\"error\": \"agent is required\"}, status=400)\n\n        agent_dir = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id\n        prompt_file = agent_dir / \"PROMPT.md\"\n        if not prompt_file.exists():\n            return self._send_json({\"error\": f\"Agent '{agent_id}' not found or no PROMPT.md\"}, status=404)\n\n        # Launch claude in the agent directory, reading PROMPT.md\n        try:\n            proc = subprocess.Popen(\n                [\"claude\", \"--print\", \"$(cat PROMPT.md)\"],\n                cwd=str(agent_dir),\n                shell=True,\n                stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n                stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n            )\n        except FileNotFoundError:\n            proc = subprocess.Popen(\n                [\"claude\", \"--print\", prompt_file.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")],\n                cwd=str(agent_dir),\n                stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n                stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n            )\n\n        self._send_json({\n            \"agent\": agent_id,\n            \"pid\": proc.pid,\n            \"status\": \"started\",\n        })\n\n    # --- Loop control handlers ---\n\n    def _handle_loopcli_status(self):\n        state = get_loop_state()\n        pid = state.get(\"pid\")\n        if state.get(\"status\") == \"running\" and pid and not _is_pid_alive(pid):\n            state[\"status\"] = \"stopped\"\n            state[\"pid\"] = None\n            state[\"ended_at\"] = datetime.now().isoformat()\n            set_loop_state(state)\n\n        uptime = 0\n        if state.get(\"started_at\"):\n            try:\n                started = datetime.fromisoformat(state[\"started_at\"])\n                uptime = int((datetime.now() - started).total_seconds())\n            except (ValueError, TypeError):\n                pass\n        state[\"uptime_seconds\"] = uptime\n        self._send_json(state)\n\n    def _handle_loopcli_start(self):\n        body = self._read_body()\n        iterations = int(body.get(\"iterations\", 0))\n        data, status = start_loopcli_process(iterations)\n        self._send_json(data, status)\n\n    def _handle_loopcli_stop(self):\n        data, status = stop_loopcli_process()\n        self._send_json(data, status)\n\n    def _handle_loopcli_restart(self):\n        stop_loopcli_process()\n        time.sleep(0.5)\n        body = self._read_body()\n        iterations = int(body.get(\"iterations\", 0))\n        data, status = start_loopcli_process(iterations)\n        self._send_json(data, status)\n\n    def _handle_loopcli_dispatch(self):\n        body = self._read_body()\n        agent_id = body.get(\"agent\", \"\").strip()\n        title = body.get(\"title\", \"\").strip()\n        if not agent_id or not title:\n            return self._send_json({\"error\": \"agent and title are required\"}, status=400)\n\n        agent_dir = LOOPCLI_ROOT / agent_id\n        if not (agent_dir / \"AGENT\").exists():\n            return self._send_json({\"error\": f\"Agent '{agent_id}' not found\"}, status=404)\n\n        # Write task to agent's tasks.json\n        tasks_file = agent_dir / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\"\n        tasks = read_json(tasks_file, [])\n        new_id = max((t.get(\"id\", 0) for t in tasks), default=0) + 1\n        task = {\n            \"id\": new_id,\n            \"status\": \"pending\",\n            \"title\": title,\n            \"description\": body.get(\"description\", \"\"),\n            \"created\": datetime.now(timezone.utc).strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d\"),\n            \"assignee\": agent_id,\n        }\n        tasks.append(task)\n        write_json(tasks_file, tasks)\n\n        # Start claude process for this agent\n        prompt_file = agent_dir / \"PROMPT.md\"\n        prompt = \"\"\n        if prompt_file.exists():\n            prompt = prompt_file.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\n        proc = subprocess.Popen(\n            [\"claude\", \"--print\", \"--dangerously-skip-permissions\"],\n            stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\n            stdout=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n            stderr=subprocess.DEVNULL,\n            cwd=str(agent_dir),\n        )\n        if prompt:\n            proc.stdin.write(prompt.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n            proc.stdin.close()\n\n        self._send_json({\n            \"task\": task,\n            \"pid\": proc.pid,\n            \"status\": \"dispatched\",\n        }, status=201)\n\n\nclass ThreadedHTTPServer(ThreadingMixIn, HTTPServer):\n    daemon_threads = True\n\n\ndef main():\n    host = \"0.0.0.0\"\n    port = 8080\n    server = ThreadedHTTPServer((host, port), WebUIHandler)\n    print(f\"LoopCLI WebUI Server running on http://{host}:{port}\")\n    print(f\"Static files served from: {WEBUI_DIR}\")\n    print(f\"Agent root: {LOOPCLI_ROOT}\")\n    print(\"Press Ctrl+C to stop.\")\n    try:\n        server.serve_forever()\n    except KeyboardInterrupt:\n        print(\"\\nShutting down.\")\n        server.server_close()\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","numLines":486,"startLine":1,"totalLines":486}}}
