{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_510243806ab94ee6b516c3d6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 收件箱\n2\t\n3\t每个 Agent 有自己的收件箱，用于接收消息和任务结果。\n4\t\n5\t## 位置\n6\t`D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\`\n7\t\n8\t## 用法\n9\t发送消息给某 Agent：\n10\t```\n11\t写入 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\<来源>_<时间戳>.md\n12\t```\n13\t\n14\t格式：\n15\t```markdown\n16\t# 来自 <来源> 的消息\n17\t- 类型：任务结果 / 通知 / 协作请求\n18\t- 内容：...\n19\t```\n20\t\n21\t## 示例\n22\t- `main\\inbox\\code-reviewer_20260521.md` — 代码审查员发给 main 的审查报告\n23\t- `frontend-dev\\inbox\\main_20260521.md` — main 给前端开发者的新需求\n24\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"919a7148-5621-42bf-8d0b-ae3a5846fdc8","uuid":"b142eb3d-e745-4ed8-a8c1-a66f0bb393a7","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:04:11.553Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\inbox.md","content":"# Skill: 收件箱\n\n每个 Agent 有自己的收件箱，用于接收消息和任务结果。\n\n## 位置\n`D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\`\n\n## 用法\n发送消息给某 Agent：\n```\n写入 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>\\inbox\\<来源>_<时间戳>.md\n```\n\n格式：\n```markdown\n# 来自 <来源> 的消息\n- 类型：任务结果 / 通知 / 协作请求\n- 内容：...\n```\n\n## 示例\n- `main\\inbox\\code-reviewer_20260521.md` — 代码审查员发给 main 的审查报告\n- `frontend-dev\\inbox\\main_20260521.md` — main 给前端开发者的新需求\n","numLines":24,"startLine":1,"totalLines":24}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_d3d55ee262cb46c898f6aca8","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 汇报状态\n2\t\n3\t完成任务后更新自己的状态文件。\n4\t\n5\t```bash\n6\t# 更新 state.json\n7\t{\n8\t  \"status\": \"idle\",\n9\t  \"last_run\": \"<当前时间>\",\n10\t  \"run_count\": \"<自增>\"\n11\t}\n12\t```\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"919a7148-5621-42bf-8d0b-ae3a5846fdc8","uuid":"c8ece89e-ee9b-49b2-843e-370843abb085","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:04:11.553Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\report.md","content":"# Skill: 汇报状态\n\n完成任务后更新自己的状态文件。\n\n```bash\n# 更新 state.json\n{\n  \"status\": \"idle\",\n  \"last_run\": \"<当前时间>\",\n  \"run_count\": \"<自增>\"\n}\n```\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_464f203705354cb28af592dd","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"\n2\tTests for webui/server.py — API endpoints and helper functions.\n3\tUses a real threaded HTTP server with httpx client.\n4\t\"\"\"\n5\t\n6\timport json\n7\timport os\n8\timport sys\n9\timport time\n10\timport threading\n11\timport pytest\n12\timport httpx\n13\t\n14\t# Add webui directory to path so we can import server\n15\tsys.path.insert(0, os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"..\", \"webui\"))\n16\t\n17\tfrom server import (\n18\t    _safe_agent_path,\n19\t    read_json,\n20\t    write_json,\n21\t    scan_agents,\n22\t    get_main_tasks,\n23\t    get_recent_lines,\n24\t    WebUIHandler,\n25\t    ThreadedHTTPServer,\n26\t    LOOPCLI_ROOT,\n27\t    MAIN_DIR,\n28\t)\n29\tfrom pathlib import Path\n30\t\n31\t\n32\t# ─── Fixtures ───\n33\t\n34\tBASE_PORT = 18765\n35\t_port_lock = threading.Lock()\n36\t_port_counter = [0]\n37\t\n38\t\n39\tdef _get_port():\n40\t    with _port_lock:\n41\t        _port_counter[0] += 1\n42\t        return BASE_PORT + _port_counter[0]\n43\t\n44\t\n45\t@pytest.fixture(scope=\"module\")\n46\tdef http_server():\n47\t    \"\"\"Start a real HTTP server in a thread for the entire module.\"\"\"\n48\t    port = _get_port()\n49\t    server = ThreadedHTTPServer((\"127.0.0.1\", port), WebUIHandler)\n50\t    t = threading.Thread(target=server.serve_forever, daemon=True)\n51\t    t.start()\n52\t    time.sleep(0.2)\n53\t    yield f\"http://127.0.0.1:{port}\"\n54\t    server.shutdown()\n55\t\n56\t\n57\t@pytest.fixture\n58\tdef client(http_server):\n59\t    return httpx.Client(base_url=http_server, timeout=5)\n60\t\n61\t\n62\t# ─── Helper: _safe_agent_path ───\n63\t\n64\tclass TestSafeAgentPath:\n65\t    def test_valid_agent(self):\n66\t        result = _safe_agent_path(\"main\")\n67\t        assert result is not None\n68\t        assert result == LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\"\n69\t\n70\t    def test_empty_string(self):\n71\t        assert _safe_agent_path(\"\") is None\n72\t\n73\t    def test_slash_traversal(self):\n74\t        assert _safe_agent_path(\"main/../../../etc\") is None\n75\t\n76\t    def test_backslash_traversal(self):\n77\t        assert _safe_agent_path(\"main\\\\..\\\\..\\\\etc\") is None\n78\t\n79\t    def test_double_dot(self):\n80\t        assert _safe_agent_path(\"..\") is None\n81\t\n82\t    def test_path_with_slash(self):\n83\t        assert _safe_agent_path(\"foo/bar\") is None\n84\t\n85\t    def test_path_with_backslash(self):\n86\t        assert _safe_agent_path(\"foo\\\\bar\") is None\n87\t\n88\t    def test_valid_subdir_name(self):\n89\t        result = _safe_agent_path(\"engineering-frontend-developer\")\n90\t        assert result is not None\n91\t        assert result.name == \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n92\t\n93\t\n94\t# ─── Helper: read_json / write_json ───\n95\t\n96\tclass TestJsonIO:\n97\t    def test_read_nonexistent_returns_default(self, tmp_path):\n98\t        result = read_json(tmp_path / \"nope.json\", {\"x\": 1})\n99\t        assert result == {\"x\": 1}\n100\t\n101\t    def test_read_nonexistent_no_default(self, tmp_path):\n102\t        result = read_json(tmp_path / \"nope.json\")\n103\t        assert result == {}\n104\t\n105\t    def test_read_valid_json(self, tmp_path):\n106\t        p = tmp_path / \"test.json\"\n107\t        p.write_text('{\"a\": 1}', encoding=\"utf-8\")\n108\t        assert read_json(p) == {\"a\": 1}\n109\t\n110\t    def test_read_corrupt_json(self, tmp_path):\n111\t        p = tmp_path / \"bad.json\"\n112\t        p.write_text(\"{invalid\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n113\t        assert read_json(p, \"fallback\") == \"fallback\"\n114\t\n115\t    def test_write_json_creates_dirs(self, tmp_path):\n116\t        p = tmp_path / \"sub\" / \"dir\" / \"out.json\"\n117\t        write_json(p, {\"k\": \"v\"})\n118\t        assert p.exists()\n119\t        assert json.loads(p.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")) == {\"k\": \"v\"}\n120\t\n121\t    def test_roundtrip(self, tmp_path):\n122\t        p = tmp_path / \"rt.json\"\n123\t        data = {\"hello\": \"世界\", \"num\": 42}\n124\t        write_json(p, data)\n125\t        assert read_json(p) == data\n126\t\n127\t\n128\t# ─── Helper: get_recent_lines ───\n129\t\n130\tclass TestGetRecentLines:\n131\t    def test_nonexistent_file(self, tmp_path):\n132\t        assert get_recent_lines(tmp_path / \"nope.log\") == []\n133\t\n134\t    def test_reads_last_n(self, tmp_path):\n135\t        p = tmp_path / \"test.log\"\n136\t        p.write_text(\"\\n\".join(f\"line {i}\" for i in range(10)), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n137\t        lines = get_recent_lines(p, 3)\n138\t        assert len(lines) == 3\n139\t        assert lines[0] == \"line 7\"\n140\t\n141\t    def test_all_lines_if_fewer_than_n(self, tmp_path):\n142\t        p = tmp_path / \"short.log\"\n143\t        p.write_text(\"a\\nb\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n144\t        lines = get_recent_lines(p, 100)\n145\t        assert len(lines) == 2\n146\t\n147\t\n148\t# ─── Helper: scan_agents ───\n149\t\n150\tclass TestScanAgents:\n151\t    def test_returns_list(self):\n152\t        agents = scan_agents()\n153\t        assert isinstance(agents, list)\n154\t\n155\t    def test_main_agent_present(self):\n156\t        agents = scan_agents()\n157\t        names = [a[\"id\"] for a in agents]\n158\t        assert \"main\" in names\n159\t\n160\t    def test_agent_has_required_fields(self):\n161\t        agents = scan_agents()\n162\t        for a in agents:\n163\t            assert \"id\" in a\n164\t            assert \"name\" in a\n165\t            assert \"status\" in a\n166\t\n167\t\n168\t# ─── API: GET /api/agents ───\n169\t\n170\tclass TestGetAgents:\n171\t    def test_returns_200(self, client):\n172\t        r = client.get(\"/api/agents\")\n173\t        assert r.status_code == 200\n174\t\n175\t    def test_returns_json_list(self, client):\n176\t        r = client.get(\"/api/agents\")\n177\t        data = r.json()\n178\t        assert isinstance(data, list)\n179\t\n180\t    def test_includes_main(self, client):\n181\t        r = client.get(\"/api/agents\")\n182\t        names = [a[\"id\"] for a in r.json()]\n183\t        assert \"main\" in names\n184\t\n185\t\n186\t# ─── API: GET /api/tasks ───\n187\t\n188\tclass TestGetTasks:\n189\t    def test_returns_200(self, client):\n190\t        r = client.get(\"/api/tasks\")\n191\t        assert r.status_code == 200\n192\t\n193\t    def test_returns_json_list(self, client):\n194\t        r = client.get(\"/api/tasks\")\n195\t        assert isinstance(r.json(), list)\n196\t\n197\t\n198\t# ─── API: POST /api/tasks ───\n199\t\n200\tclass TestCreateTask:\n201\t    def test_create_task_success(self, client):\n202\t        # Read current tasks to find a safe ID range\n203\t        tasks_before = client.get(\"/api/tasks\").json()\n204\t        r = client.post(\"/api/tasks\", json={\n205\t            \"title\": f\"[TEST] unit test task {time.time()}\",\n206\t            \"description\": \"created by automated test\",\n207\t            \"assignee\": \"main\",\n208\t        })\n209\t        assert r.status_code == 201\n210\t        data = r.json()\n211\t        assert data[\"status\"] == \"pending\"\n212\t        assert data[\"title\"].startswith(\"[TEST]\")\n213\t\n214\t        # Cleanup: remove the test task\n215\t        tasks_after = client.get(\"/api/tasks\").json()\n216\t        test_tasks = [t for t in tasks_after if t[\"title\"].startswith(\"[TEST]\")]\n217\t        if test_tasks:\n218\t            cleaned = [t for t in tasks_after if not t[\"title\"].startswith(\"[TEST]\")]\n219\t            # Restore original tasks\n220\t            write_json(MAIN_DIR / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\", tasks_before)\n221\t\n222\t    def test_create_task_missing_title(self, client):\n223\t        r = client.post(\"/api/tasks\", json={\"description\": \"no title\"})\n224\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n225\t        assert \"error\" in r.json()\n226\t\n227\t    def test_create_task_empty_body(self, client):\n228\t        r = client.post(\"/api/tasks\", json={})\n229\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n230\t\n231\t\n232\t# ─── API: POST /api/messages/send ───\n233\t\n234\tclass TestMessageSend:\n235\t    def test_send_to_main(self, client):\n236\t        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n237\t            \"content\": f\"test message {time.time()}\",\n238\t            \"agent\": \"main\",\n239\t        })\n240\t        assert r.status_code == 201\n241\t        data = r.json()\n242\t        assert data[\"status\"] == \"sent\"\n243\t        assert data[\"agent\"] == \"main\"\n244\t\n245\t        # Cleanup the test message\n246\t        if data.get(\"file\"):\n247\t            msg_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\" / \"inbox\" / data[\"file\"]\n248\t            if msg_path.exists():\n249\t                msg_path.unlink()\n250\t\n251\t    def test_send_default_agent_is_main(self, client):\n252\t        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n253\t            \"content\": f\"default agent test {time.time()}\",\n254\t        })\n255\t        assert r.status_code == 201\n256\t        assert r.json()[\"agent\"] == \"main\"\n257\t\n258\t        # Cleanup\n259\t        data = r.json()\n260\t        if data.get(\"file\"):\n261\t            msg_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\" / \"inbox\" / data[\"file\"]\n262\t            if msg_path.exists():\n263\t                msg_path.unlink()\n264\t\n265\t    def test_send_empty_content(self, client):\n266\t        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\"content\": \"\"})\n267\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n268\t\n269\t    def test_send_to_invalid_agent(self, client):\n270\t        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n271\t            \"content\": \"hello\",\n272\t            \"agent\": \"../etc\",\n273\t        })\n274\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n275\t\n276\t    def test_send_to_nonexistent_agent(self, client):\n277\t        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n278\t            \"content\": \"hello\",\n279\t            \"agent\": \"nonexistent_agent_xyz\",\n280\t        })\n281\t        assert r.status_code == 404\n282\t\n283\t\n284\t# ─── API: Path traversal rejection ───\n285\t\n286\tclass TestPathTraversal:\n287\t    def test_agents_endpoint_rejects_traversal(self, client):\n288\t        # /api/logs?agent=../etc should be rejected\n289\t        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"../etc\"})\n290\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n291\t\n292\t    def test_agents_endpoint_rejects_dotdot(self, client):\n293\t        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"..\"})\n294\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n295\t\n296\t    def test_messages_send_rejects_traversal(self, client):\n297\t        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n298\t            \"content\": \"test\",\n299\t            \"agent\": \"../etc\",\n300\t        })\n301\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n302\t\n303\t\n304\t# ─── API: GET /api/logs ───\n305\t\n306\tclass TestGetLogs:\n307\t    def test_returns_200(self, client):\n308\t        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\")\n309\t        assert r.status_code == 200\n310\t        data = r.json()\n311\t        assert \"lines\" in data\n312\t\n313\t    def test_with_valid_agent(self, client):\n314\t        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"main\"})\n315\t        assert r.status_code == 200\n316\t\n317\t    def test_with_invalid_agent(self, client):\n318\t        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"../etc\"})\n319\t        assert r.status_code == 400\n320\t\n321\t\n322\t# ─── API: OPTIONS (CORS) ───\n323\t\n324\tclass TestCORS:\n325\t    def test_options_returns_204(self, client):\n326\t        r = client.options(\"/api/agents\")\n327\t        assert r.status_code == 204\n328\t        assert r.headers.get(\"access-control-allow-origin\") == \"*\"\n329\t\n330\t\n331\t# ─── API: 404 for unknown POST ───\n332\t\n333\tclass TestNotFound:\n334\t    def test_unknown_post_returns_404(self, client):\n335\t        r = client.post(\"/api/nonexistent\")\n336\t        assert r.status_code == 404\n337\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"919a7148-5621-42bf-8d0b-ae3a5846fdc8","uuid":"c9bff28e-86d2-48cd-b303-d16a8f7e0bdd","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:04:11.554Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\main\\tests\\test_server.py","content":"\"\"\"\nTests for webui/server.py — API endpoints and helper functions.\nUses a real threaded HTTP server with httpx client.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport time\nimport threading\nimport pytest\nimport httpx\n\n# Add webui directory to path so we can import server\nsys.path.insert(0, os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), \"..\", \"webui\"))\n\nfrom server import (\n    _safe_agent_path,\n    read_json,\n    write_json,\n    scan_agents,\n    get_main_tasks,\n    get_recent_lines,\n    WebUIHandler,\n    ThreadedHTTPServer,\n    LOOPCLI_ROOT,\n    MAIN_DIR,\n)\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\n# ─── Fixtures ───\n\nBASE_PORT = 18765\n_port_lock = threading.Lock()\n_port_counter = [0]\n\n\ndef _get_port():\n    with _port_lock:\n        _port_counter[0] += 1\n        return BASE_PORT + _port_counter[0]\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"module\")\ndef http_server():\n    \"\"\"Start a real HTTP server in a thread for the entire module.\"\"\"\n    port = _get_port()\n    server = ThreadedHTTPServer((\"127.0.0.1\", port), WebUIHandler)\n    t = threading.Thread(target=server.serve_forever, daemon=True)\n    t.start()\n    time.sleep(0.2)\n    yield f\"http://127.0.0.1:{port}\"\n    server.shutdown()\n\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef client(http_server):\n    return httpx.Client(base_url=http_server, timeout=5)\n\n\n# ─── Helper: _safe_agent_path ───\n\nclass TestSafeAgentPath:\n    def test_valid_agent(self):\n        result = _safe_agent_path(\"main\")\n        assert result is not None\n        assert result == LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\"\n\n    def test_empty_string(self):\n        assert _safe_agent_path(\"\") is None\n\n    def test_slash_traversal(self):\n        assert _safe_agent_path(\"main/../../../etc\") is None\n\n    def test_backslash_traversal(self):\n        assert _safe_agent_path(\"main\\\\..\\\\..\\\\etc\") is None\n\n    def test_double_dot(self):\n        assert _safe_agent_path(\"..\") is None\n\n    def test_path_with_slash(self):\n        assert _safe_agent_path(\"foo/bar\") is None\n\n    def test_path_with_backslash(self):\n        assert _safe_agent_path(\"foo\\\\bar\") is None\n\n    def test_valid_subdir_name(self):\n        result = _safe_agent_path(\"engineering-frontend-developer\")\n        assert result is not None\n        assert result.name == \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n\n\n# ─── Helper: read_json / write_json ───\n\nclass TestJsonIO:\n    def test_read_nonexistent_returns_default(self, tmp_path):\n        result = read_json(tmp_path / \"nope.json\", {\"x\": 1})\n        assert result == {\"x\": 1}\n\n    def test_read_nonexistent_no_default(self, tmp_path):\n        result = read_json(tmp_path / \"nope.json\")\n        assert result == {}\n\n    def test_read_valid_json(self, tmp_path):\n        p = tmp_path / \"test.json\"\n        p.write_text('{\"a\": 1}', encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        assert read_json(p) == {\"a\": 1}\n\n    def test_read_corrupt_json(self, tmp_path):\n        p = tmp_path / \"bad.json\"\n        p.write_text(\"{invalid\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        assert read_json(p, \"fallback\") == \"fallback\"\n\n    def test_write_json_creates_dirs(self, tmp_path):\n        p = tmp_path / \"sub\" / \"dir\" / \"out.json\"\n        write_json(p, {\"k\": \"v\"})\n        assert p.exists()\n        assert json.loads(p.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")) == {\"k\": \"v\"}\n\n    def test_roundtrip(self, tmp_path):\n        p = tmp_path / \"rt.json\"\n        data = {\"hello\": \"世界\", \"num\": 42}\n        write_json(p, data)\n        assert read_json(p) == data\n\n\n# ─── Helper: get_recent_lines ───\n\nclass TestGetRecentLines:\n    def test_nonexistent_file(self, tmp_path):\n        assert get_recent_lines(tmp_path / \"nope.log\") == []\n\n    def test_reads_last_n(self, tmp_path):\n        p = tmp_path / \"test.log\"\n        p.write_text(\"\\n\".join(f\"line {i}\" for i in range(10)), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        lines = get_recent_lines(p, 3)\n        assert len(lines) == 3\n        assert lines[0] == \"line 7\"\n\n    def test_all_lines_if_fewer_than_n(self, tmp_path):\n        p = tmp_path / \"short.log\"\n        p.write_text(\"a\\nb\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        lines = get_recent_lines(p, 100)\n        assert len(lines) == 2\n\n\n# ─── Helper: scan_agents ───\n\nclass TestScanAgents:\n    def test_returns_list(self):\n        agents = scan_agents()\n        assert isinstance(agents, list)\n\n    def test_main_agent_present(self):\n        agents = scan_agents()\n        names = [a[\"id\"] for a in agents]\n        assert \"main\" in names\n\n    def test_agent_has_required_fields(self):\n        agents = scan_agents()\n        for a in agents:\n            assert \"id\" in a\n            assert \"name\" in a\n            assert \"status\" in a\n\n\n# ─── API: GET /api/agents ───\n\nclass TestGetAgents:\n    def test_returns_200(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/agents\")\n        assert r.status_code == 200\n\n    def test_returns_json_list(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/agents\")\n        data = r.json()\n        assert isinstance(data, list)\n\n    def test_includes_main(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/agents\")\n        names = [a[\"id\"] for a in r.json()]\n        assert \"main\" in names\n\n\n# ─── API: GET /api/tasks ───\n\nclass TestGetTasks:\n    def test_returns_200(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/tasks\")\n        assert r.status_code == 200\n\n    def test_returns_json_list(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/tasks\")\n        assert isinstance(r.json(), list)\n\n\n# ─── API: POST /api/tasks ───\n\nclass TestCreateTask:\n    def test_create_task_success(self, client):\n        # Read current tasks to find a safe ID range\n        tasks_before = client.get(\"/api/tasks\").json()\n        r = client.post(\"/api/tasks\", json={\n            \"title\": f\"[TEST] unit test task {time.time()}\",\n            \"description\": \"created by automated test\",\n            \"assignee\": \"main\",\n        })\n        assert r.status_code == 201\n        data = r.json()\n        assert data[\"status\"] == \"pending\"\n        assert data[\"title\"].startswith(\"[TEST]\")\n\n        # Cleanup: remove the test task\n        tasks_after = client.get(\"/api/tasks\").json()\n        test_tasks = [t for t in tasks_after if t[\"title\"].startswith(\"[TEST]\")]\n        if test_tasks:\n            cleaned = [t for t in tasks_after if not t[\"title\"].startswith(\"[TEST]\")]\n            # Restore original tasks\n            write_json(MAIN_DIR / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\", tasks_before)\n\n    def test_create_task_missing_title(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/tasks\", json={\"description\": \"no title\"})\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n        assert \"error\" in r.json()\n\n    def test_create_task_empty_body(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/tasks\", json={})\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n\n\n# ─── API: POST /api/messages/send ───\n\nclass TestMessageSend:\n    def test_send_to_main(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n            \"content\": f\"test message {time.time()}\",\n            \"agent\": \"main\",\n        })\n        assert r.status_code == 201\n        data = r.json()\n        assert data[\"status\"] == \"sent\"\n        assert data[\"agent\"] == \"main\"\n\n        # Cleanup the test message\n        if data.get(\"file\"):\n            msg_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\" / \"inbox\" / data[\"file\"]\n            if msg_path.exists():\n                msg_path.unlink()\n\n    def test_send_default_agent_is_main(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n            \"content\": f\"default agent test {time.time()}\",\n        })\n        assert r.status_code == 201\n        assert r.json()[\"agent\"] == \"main\"\n\n        # Cleanup\n        data = r.json()\n        if data.get(\"file\"):\n            msg_path = LOOPCLI_ROOT / \"main\" / \"inbox\" / data[\"file\"]\n            if msg_path.exists():\n                msg_path.unlink()\n\n    def test_send_empty_content(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\"content\": \"\"})\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n\n    def test_send_to_invalid_agent(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n            \"content\": \"hello\",\n            \"agent\": \"../etc\",\n        })\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n\n    def test_send_to_nonexistent_agent(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n            \"content\": \"hello\",\n            \"agent\": \"nonexistent_agent_xyz\",\n        })\n        assert r.status_code == 404\n\n\n# ─── API: Path traversal rejection ───\n\nclass TestPathTraversal:\n    def test_agents_endpoint_rejects_traversal(self, client):\n        # /api/logs?agent=../etc should be rejected\n        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"../etc\"})\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n\n    def test_agents_endpoint_rejects_dotdot(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"..\"})\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n\n    def test_messages_send_rejects_traversal(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/messages/send\", json={\n            \"content\": \"test\",\n            \"agent\": \"../etc\",\n        })\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n\n\n# ─── API: GET /api/logs ───\n\nclass TestGetLogs:\n    def test_returns_200(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\")\n        assert r.status_code == 200\n        data = r.json()\n        assert \"lines\" in data\n\n    def test_with_valid_agent(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"main\"})\n        assert r.status_code == 200\n\n    def test_with_invalid_agent(self, client):\n        r = client.get(\"/api/logs\", params={\"agent\": \"../etc\"})\n        assert r.status_code == 400\n\n\n# ─── API: OPTIONS (CORS) ───\n\nclass TestCORS:\n    def test_options_returns_204(self, client):\n        r = client.options(\"/api/agents\")\n        assert r.status_code == 204\n        assert r.headers.get(\"access-control-allow-origin\") == \"*\"\n\n\n# ─── API: 404 for unknown POST ───\n\nclass TestNotFound:\n    def test_unknown_post_returns_404(self, client):\n        r = client.post(\"/api/nonexistent\")\n        assert r.status_code == 404\n","numLines":337,"startLine":1,"totalLines":337}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_7311fb01a7af48859f6f035d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 派发任务\n2\t\n3\t给已有 Agent 添加新任务。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```bash\n7\tloopcli task <agent目录名> \"任务标题\" --desc \"任务描述\"\n8\t```\n9\t\n10\t## 执行逻辑\n11\t1. 找到 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>/memory/tasks.json\n12\t2. 追加新任务：{ id: 自增, status: \"pending\", title, description, created, assignee }\n13\t3. 写回 tasks.json\n14\t\n15\t## 示例\n16\t```bash\n17\tloopcli task engineering-frontend-developer \"优化首页加载\" --desc \"Lighthouse 60分 → 90+\"\n18\tloopcli task main \"部署到生产环境\" --desc \"合并 staging 分支并部署\"\n19\t```\n20\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"919a7148-5621-42bf-8d0b-ae3a5846fdc8","uuid":"87c89bc0-f464-4a12-8868-12d73b265635","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:04:11.555Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\assign-task.md","content":"# Skill: 派发任务\n\n给已有 Agent 添加新任务。\n\n## 用法\n```bash\nloopcli task <agent目录名> \"任务标题\" --desc \"任务描述\"\n```\n\n## 执行逻辑\n1. 找到 D:\\loopcli\\<agent名>/memory/tasks.json\n2. 追加新任务：{ id: 自增, status: \"pending\", title, description, created, assignee }\n3. 写回 tasks.json\n\n## 示例\n```bash\nloopcli task engineering-frontend-developer \"优化首页加载\" --desc \"Lighthouse 60分 → 90+\"\nloopcli task main \"部署到生产环境\" --desc \"合并 staging 分支并部署\"\n```\n","numLines":20,"startLine":1,"totalLines":20}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_8c0563912657484d881c76cb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 发送消息\n2\t\n3\t向其他 Agent 的收件箱发送消息。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```\n7\t写入目标 Agent 的 inbox 目录：\n8\tD:\\loopcli\\<目标agent名>\\inbox\\<自己的名字>_<时间戳>.md\n9\t```\n10\t\n11\t## 文件格式\n12\t```markdown\n13\t# 来自 <你的名字>\n14\t- 类型：任务完成 / 通知 / 错误报告\n15\t- 内容：具体信息\n16\t```\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"919a7148-5621-42bf-8d0b-ae3a5846fdc8","uuid":"b5124270-29e2-4bcb-bfea-69b7a0247b17","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:04:11.556Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\outbox.md","content":"# Skill: 发送消息\n\n向其他 Agent 的收件箱发送消息。\n\n## 用法\n```\n写入目标 Agent 的 inbox 目录：\nD:\\loopcli\\<目标agent名>\\inbox\\<自己的名字>_<时间戳>.md\n```\n\n## 文件格式\n```markdown\n# 来自 <你的名字>\n- 类型：任务完成 / 通知 / 错误报告\n- 内容：具体信息\n```\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_211a229a2c614c77b194ea78","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"\n2\tTests for run.py — agent discovery, task management, and helper functions.\n3\t\"\"\"\n4\t\n5\timport json\n6\timport os\n7\timport sys\n8\timport pytest\n9\t\n10\t# run.py calls parser.parse_args() at module level, so we must\n11\t# provide valid argv before importing. \"list\" is a safe no-side-effect command.\n12\t_original_argv = sys.argv.copy()\n13\tsys.argv = [\"run.py\", \"list\"]\n14\tsys.path.insert(0, r\"D:\\loopcli\")\n15\tfrom run import (\n16\t    get_agent_marker,\n17\t    is_agent_enabled,\n18\t    discover_agents,\n19\t    find_template,\n20\t    load_agent_state,\n21\t    load_agent_tasks,\n22\t    cmd_task_inner,\n23\t    LOOPCLI_DIR,\n24\t    AGENT_MARKER,\n25\t)\n26\tsys.argv = _original_argv\n27\t\n28\tfrom pathlib import Path\n29\t\n30\t\n31\t# ─── Fixtures ───\n32\t\n33\t@pytest.fixture\n34\tdef fake_agent(tmp_path):\n35\t    \"\"\"Create a minimal fake agent directory for testing.\"\"\"\n36\t    agent_dir = tmp_path / \"test-agent\"\n37\t    agent_dir.mkdir()\n38\t    (agent_dir / AGENT_MARKER).write_text(\"type: main\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n39\t    mem_dir = agent_dir / \"memory\"\n40\t    mem_dir.mkdir()\n41\t    (mem_dir / \"state.json\").write_text(json.dumps({\n42\t        \"agent\": \"test-agent\",\n43\t        \"status\": \"idle\",\n44\t        \"run_count\": 0,\n45\t    }), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n46\t    (mem_dir / \"tasks.json\").write_text(\"[]\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n47\t    log_dir = agent_dir / \"log\"\n48\t    log_dir.mkdir()\n49\t    return agent_dir\n50\t\n51\t\n52\t# ─── get_agent_marker ───\n53\t\n54\tclass TestGetAgentMarker:\n55\t    def test_reads_valid_marker(self, fake_agent):\n56\t        content = get_agent_marker(str(fake_agent))\n57\t        assert content == \"type: main\"\n58\t\n59\t    def test_returns_none_for_missing(self, tmp_path):\n60\t        assert get_agent_marker(str(tmp_path / \"nonexistent\")) is None\n61\t\n62\t    def test_reads_disabled_marker(self, tmp_path):\n63\t        d = tmp_path / \"disabled-agent\"\n64\t        d.mkdir()\n65\t        (d / AGENT_MARKER).write_text(\"type: main\\ndisabled: true\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n66\t        content = get_agent_marker(str(d))\n67\t        assert \"disabled\" in content\n68\t\n69\t\n70\t# ─── is_agent_enabled ───\n71\t\n72\tclass TestIsAgentEnabled:\n73\t    def test_enabled_agent(self, fake_agent):\n74\t        assert is_agent_enabled(str(fake_agent)) is True\n75\t\n76\t    def test_disabled_agent(self, tmp_path):\n77\t        d = tmp_path / \"disabled\"\n78\t        d.mkdir()\n79\t        (d / AGENT_MARKER).write_text(\"type: main\\ndisabled: true\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n80\t        assert is_agent_enabled(str(d)) is False\n81\t\n82\t    def test_no_marker(self, tmp_path):\n83\t        assert is_agent_enabled(str(tmp_path)) is False\n84\t\n85\t\n86\t# ─── discover_agents ───\n87\t\n88\tclass TestDiscoverAgents:\n89\t    def test_finds_real_agents(self):\n90\t        agents = discover_agents()\n91\t        assert isinstance(agents, list)\n92\t        # main should always be discovered\n93\t        names = [a[\"name\"] for a in agents]\n94\t        assert \"main\" in names\n95\t\n96\t    def test_agent_has_required_keys(self):\n97\t        agents = discover_agents()\n98\t        for a in agents:\n99\t            assert \"name\" in a\n100\t            assert \"path\" in a\n101\t\n102\t    def test_excludes_disabled(self):\n103\t        # discover_agents() without include_disabled should skip disabled agents\n104\t        agents = discover_agents(include_disabled=False)\n105\t        # Verify none of the returned agents are disabled\n106\t        for a in agents:\n107\t            assert is_agent_enabled(a[\"path\"])\n108\t\n109\t\n110\t# ─── find_template ───\n111\t\n112\tclass TestFindTemplate:\n113\t    def test_existing_template(self):\n114\t        result = find_template(\"engineering-frontend-developer\")\n115\t        if result:\n116\t            assert result.endswith(\"engineering-frontend-developer.md\")\n117\t            assert os.path.isfile(result)\n118\t\n119\t    def test_nonexistent_template(self):\n120\t        result = find_template(\"nonexistent-template-xyz-999\")\n121\t        assert result is None\n122\t\n123\t\n124\t# ─── load_agent_state ───\n125\t\n126\tclass TestLoadAgentState:\n127\t    def test_loads_main_state(self):\n128\t        main_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"main\")\n129\t        state = load_agent_state(main_dir)\n130\t        assert state is not None\n131\t        assert state.get(\"agent\", \"\").lower() == \"main\"\n132\t\n133\t    def test_loads_state_from_fixture(self, fake_agent):\n134\t        state = load_agent_state(str(fake_agent))\n135\t        assert state[\"agent\"] == \"test-agent\"\n136\t        assert state[\"status\"] == \"idle\"\n137\t\n138\t    def test_missing_state_returns_none(self, tmp_path):\n139\t        assert load_agent_state(str(tmp_path)) is None\n140\t\n141\t\n142\t# ─── load_agent_tasks ───\n143\t\n144\tclass TestLoadAgentTasks:\n145\t    def test_loads_tasks(self, fake_agent):\n146\t        tasks = load_agent_tasks(str(fake_agent))\n147\t        assert isinstance(tasks, list)\n148\t\n149\t    def test_empty_tasks(self, fake_agent):\n150\t        tasks = load_agent_tasks(str(fake_agent))\n151\t        assert tasks == []\n152\t\n153\t    def test_missing_returns_empty(self, tmp_path):\n154\t        tasks = load_agent_tasks(str(tmp_path))\n155\t        assert tasks == []\n156\t\n157\t    def test_real_main_tasks(self):\n158\t        main_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"main\")\n159\t        tasks = load_agent_tasks(main_dir)\n160\t        assert isinstance(tasks, list)\n161\t\n162\t\n163\t# ─── cmd_task_inner ───\n164\t\n165\tclass TestCmdTaskInner:\n166\t    def test_adds_task_to_fake_agent_exits(self, fake_agent):\n167\t        \"\"\"cmd_task_inner expects agent in LOOPCLI_DIR, not tmp_path.\"\"\"\n168\t        with pytest.raises(SystemExit):\n169\t            cmd_task_inner(\"test-agent\", \"Test task title\", \"Test description\")\n170\t\n171\t    def test_adds_task_to_real_agent(self):\n172\t        \"\"\"Test adding a task to the real engineering-frontend-developer agent.\"\"\"\n173\t        agent_name = \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n174\t        agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, agent_name)\n175\t        if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n176\t            pytest.skip(\"Agent not found\")\n177\t\n178\t        tasks_before = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n179\t        count_before = len(tasks_before)\n180\t\n181\t        cmd_task_inner(agent_name, \"[TEST] unit test task\", \"[TEST] desc\")\n182\t\n183\t        tasks_after = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n184\t        assert len(tasks_after) == count_before + 1\n185\t\n186\t        new_task = tasks_after[-1]\n187\t        assert new_task[\"title\"] == \"[TEST] unit test task\"\n188\t        assert new_task[\"status\"] == \"pending\"\n189\t\n190\t        # Cleanup: remove the test task\n191\t        tasks_after.pop()\n192\t        with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n193\t            json.dump(tasks_after, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n194\t\n195\t    def test_task_id_auto_increments(self):\n196\t        agent_name = \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n197\t        agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, agent_name)\n198\t        if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n199\t            pytest.skip(\"Agent not found\")\n200\t\n201\t        tasks_before = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n202\t        max_id = max((t[\"id\"] for t in tasks_before), default=0)\n203\t\n204\t        cmd_task_inner(agent_name, \"[TEST] increment test\", \"\")\n205\t\n206\t        tasks_after = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n207\t        new_task = tasks_after[-1]\n208\t        assert new_task[\"id\"] == max_id + 1\n209\t\n210\t        # Cleanup\n211\t        tasks_after.pop()\n212\t        with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n213\t            json.dump(tasks_after, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n214\t\n215\t\n216\t# ─── Integration: agent directory structure ───\n217\t\n218\tclass TestAgentStructure:\n219\t    def test_main_has_required_files(self):\n220\t        main_dir = Path(LOOPCLI_DIR) / \"main\"\n221\t        assert (main_dir / AGENT_MARKER).exists()\n222\t        assert (main_dir / \"memory\" / \"state.json\").exists()\n223\t        assert (main_dir / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\").exists()\n224\t\n225\t    def test_frontend_agent_has_required_files(self):\n226\t        agent_dir = Path(LOOPCLI_DIR) / \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n227\t        if not (agent_dir / AGENT_MARKER).exists():\n228\t            pytest.skip(\"Agent not found\")\n229\t        assert (agent_dir / \"SOUL.md\").exists()\n230\t        assert (agent_dir / \"memory\" / \"state.json\").exists()\n231\t        assert (agent_dir / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\").exists()\n232\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"919a7148-5621-42bf-8d0b-ae3a5846fdc8","uuid":"fe109e2c-1f6f-4a71-bdc0-0f546def5e81","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:04:11.556Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\main\\tests\\test_run.py","content":"\"\"\"\nTests for run.py — agent discovery, task management, and helper functions.\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport pytest\n\n# run.py calls parser.parse_args() at module level, so we must\n# provide valid argv before importing. \"list\" is a safe no-side-effect command.\n_original_argv = sys.argv.copy()\nsys.argv = [\"run.py\", \"list\"]\nsys.path.insert(0, r\"D:\\loopcli\")\nfrom run import (\n    get_agent_marker,\n    is_agent_enabled,\n    discover_agents,\n    find_template,\n    load_agent_state,\n    load_agent_tasks,\n    cmd_task_inner,\n    LOOPCLI_DIR,\n    AGENT_MARKER,\n)\nsys.argv = _original_argv\n\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\n# ─── Fixtures ───\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef fake_agent(tmp_path):\n    \"\"\"Create a minimal fake agent directory for testing.\"\"\"\n    agent_dir = tmp_path / \"test-agent\"\n    agent_dir.mkdir()\n    (agent_dir / AGENT_MARKER).write_text(\"type: main\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    mem_dir = agent_dir / \"memory\"\n    mem_dir.mkdir()\n    (mem_dir / \"state.json\").write_text(json.dumps({\n        \"agent\": \"test-agent\",\n        \"status\": \"idle\",\n        \"run_count\": 0,\n    }), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    (mem_dir / \"tasks.json\").write_text(\"[]\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    log_dir = agent_dir / \"log\"\n    log_dir.mkdir()\n    return agent_dir\n\n\n# ─── get_agent_marker ───\n\nclass TestGetAgentMarker:\n    def test_reads_valid_marker(self, fake_agent):\n        content = get_agent_marker(str(fake_agent))\n        assert content == \"type: main\"\n\n    def test_returns_none_for_missing(self, tmp_path):\n        assert get_agent_marker(str(tmp_path / \"nonexistent\")) is None\n\n    def test_reads_disabled_marker(self, tmp_path):\n        d = tmp_path / \"disabled-agent\"\n        d.mkdir()\n        (d / AGENT_MARKER).write_text(\"type: main\\ndisabled: true\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        content = get_agent_marker(str(d))\n        assert \"disabled\" in content\n\n\n# ─── is_agent_enabled ───\n\nclass TestIsAgentEnabled:\n    def test_enabled_agent(self, fake_agent):\n        assert is_agent_enabled(str(fake_agent)) is True\n\n    def test_disabled_agent(self, tmp_path):\n        d = tmp_path / \"disabled\"\n        d.mkdir()\n        (d / AGENT_MARKER).write_text(\"type: main\\ndisabled: true\\n\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        assert is_agent_enabled(str(d)) is False\n\n    def test_no_marker(self, tmp_path):\n        assert is_agent_enabled(str(tmp_path)) is False\n\n\n# ─── discover_agents ───\n\nclass TestDiscoverAgents:\n    def test_finds_real_agents(self):\n        agents = discover_agents()\n        assert isinstance(agents, list)\n        # main should always be discovered\n        names = [a[\"name\"] for a in agents]\n        assert \"main\" in names\n\n    def test_agent_has_required_keys(self):\n        agents = discover_agents()\n        for a in agents:\n            assert \"name\" in a\n            assert \"path\" in a\n\n    def test_excludes_disabled(self):\n        # discover_agents() without include_disabled should skip disabled agents\n        agents = discover_agents(include_disabled=False)\n        # Verify none of the returned agents are disabled\n        for a in agents:\n            assert is_agent_enabled(a[\"path\"])\n\n\n# ─── find_template ───\n\nclass TestFindTemplate:\n    def test_existing_template(self):\n        result = find_template(\"engineering-frontend-developer\")\n        if result:\n            assert result.endswith(\"engineering-frontend-developer.md\")\n            assert os.path.isfile(result)\n\n    def test_nonexistent_template(self):\n        result = find_template(\"nonexistent-template-xyz-999\")\n        assert result is None\n\n\n# ─── load_agent_state ───\n\nclass TestLoadAgentState:\n    def test_loads_main_state(self):\n        main_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"main\")\n        state = load_agent_state(main_dir)\n        assert state is not None\n        assert state.get(\"agent\", \"\").lower() == \"main\"\n\n    def test_loads_state_from_fixture(self, fake_agent):\n        state = load_agent_state(str(fake_agent))\n        assert state[\"agent\"] == \"test-agent\"\n        assert state[\"status\"] == \"idle\"\n\n    def test_missing_state_returns_none(self, tmp_path):\n        assert load_agent_state(str(tmp_path)) is None\n\n\n# ─── load_agent_tasks ───\n\nclass TestLoadAgentTasks:\n    def test_loads_tasks(self, fake_agent):\n        tasks = load_agent_tasks(str(fake_agent))\n        assert isinstance(tasks, list)\n\n    def test_empty_tasks(self, fake_agent):\n        tasks = load_agent_tasks(str(fake_agent))\n        assert tasks == []\n\n    def test_missing_returns_empty(self, tmp_path):\n        tasks = load_agent_tasks(str(tmp_path))\n        assert tasks == []\n\n    def test_real_main_tasks(self):\n        main_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, \"main\")\n        tasks = load_agent_tasks(main_dir)\n        assert isinstance(tasks, list)\n\n\n# ─── cmd_task_inner ───\n\nclass TestCmdTaskInner:\n    def test_adds_task_to_fake_agent_exits(self, fake_agent):\n        \"\"\"cmd_task_inner expects agent in LOOPCLI_DIR, not tmp_path.\"\"\"\n        with pytest.raises(SystemExit):\n            cmd_task_inner(\"test-agent\", \"Test task title\", \"Test description\")\n\n    def test_adds_task_to_real_agent(self):\n        \"\"\"Test adding a task to the real engineering-frontend-developer agent.\"\"\"\n        agent_name = \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n        agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, agent_name)\n        if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n            pytest.skip(\"Agent not found\")\n\n        tasks_before = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n        count_before = len(tasks_before)\n\n        cmd_task_inner(agent_name, \"[TEST] unit test task\", \"[TEST] desc\")\n\n        tasks_after = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n        assert len(tasks_after) == count_before + 1\n\n        new_task = tasks_after[-1]\n        assert new_task[\"title\"] == \"[TEST] unit test task\"\n        assert new_task[\"status\"] == \"pending\"\n\n        # Cleanup: remove the test task\n        tasks_after.pop()\n        with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(tasks_after, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    def test_task_id_auto_increments(self):\n        agent_name = \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n        agent_dir = os.path.join(LOOPCLI_DIR, agent_name)\n        if not os.path.isfile(os.path.join(agent_dir, AGENT_MARKER)):\n            pytest.skip(\"Agent not found\")\n\n        tasks_before = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n        max_id = max((t[\"id\"] for t in tasks_before), default=0)\n\n        cmd_task_inner(agent_name, \"[TEST] increment test\", \"\")\n\n        tasks_after = load_agent_tasks(agent_dir)\n        new_task = tasks_after[-1]\n        assert new_task[\"id\"] == max_id + 1\n\n        # Cleanup\n        tasks_after.pop()\n        with open(os.path.join(agent_dir, \"memory\", \"tasks.json\"), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(tasks_after, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n\n# ─── Integration: agent directory structure ───\n\nclass TestAgentStructure:\n    def test_main_has_required_files(self):\n        main_dir = Path(LOOPCLI_DIR) / \"main\"\n        assert (main_dir / AGENT_MARKER).exists()\n        assert (main_dir / \"memory\" / \"state.json\").exists()\n        assert (main_dir / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\").exists()\n\n    def test_frontend_agent_has_required_files(self):\n        agent_dir = Path(LOOPCLI_DIR) / \"engineering-frontend-developer\"\n        if not (agent_dir / AGENT_MARKER).exists():\n            pytest.skip(\"Agent not found\")\n        assert (agent_dir / \"SOUL.md\").exists()\n        assert (agent_dir / \"memory\" / \"state.json\").exists()\n        assert (agent_dir / \"memory\" / \"tasks.json\").exists()\n","numLines":232,"startLine":1,"totalLines":232}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_9247e0dafce74da29580179a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Skill: 创建 Agent\n2\t\n3\t从模板库创建新 Agent，自动注册到 loopcli。\n4\t\n5\t## 用法\n6\t```bash\n7\tloopcli create <模板ID> --task \"任务描述\"\n8\t```\n9\t\n10\t## 模板位置\n11\tD:\\loopcli\\subagent\\，按部门分目录。模板文件格式：`<部门>/<模板ID>.md`\n12\t例如：`engineering/engineering-frontend-developer.md`\n13\t\n14\t## 执行逻辑\n15\t1. 从 subagent/<部门>/<模板ID>.md 读取模板内容\n16\t2. 在 D:\\loopcli\\<模板ID>/ 下创建目录结构：\n17\t   - AGENT（标记文件，内容为 `type: main`）\n18\t   - SOUL.md（模板内容）\n19\t   - PROMPT.md（自动生成：读取 SOUL.md，读取 memory/tasks.json，执行任务，更新状态）\n20\t   - memory/tasks.json（含传入的任务）\n21\t   - memory/state.json（初始状态）\n22\t   - log/run.md（空日志）\n23\t3. loopcli 下一轮自动发现并启动该 Agent\n24\t\n25\t## 示例\n26\t```bash\n27\tloopcli create engineering-frontend-developer --task \"开发登录页面\"\n28\tloopcli create engineering-code-reviewer --task \"审查 PR #42\"\n29\tloopcli create design-ui-designer --task \"设计仪表盘界面\"\n30\t```\n31\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"919a7148-5621-42bf-8d0b-ae3a5846fdc8","uuid":"eb6a1301-2b3c-4cab-8e1b-eb80af88123c","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:04:11.557Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\loopcli\\skill\\create-agent.md","content":"# Skill: 创建 Agent\n\n从模板库创建新 Agent，自动注册到 loopcli。\n\n## 用法\n```bash\nloopcli create <模板ID> --task \"任务描述\"\n```\n\n## 模板位置\nD:\\loopcli\\subagent\\，按部门分目录。模板文件格式：`<部门>/<模板ID>.md`\n例如：`engineering/engineering-frontend-developer.md`\n\n## 执行逻辑\n1. 从 subagent/<部门>/<模板ID>.md 读取模板内容\n2. 在 D:\\loopcli\\<模板ID>/ 下创建目录结构：\n   - AGENT（标记文件，内容为 `type: main`）\n   - SOUL.md（模板内容）\n   - PROMPT.md（自动生成：读取 SOUL.md，读取 memory/tasks.json，执行任务，更新状态）\n   - memory/tasks.json（含传入的任务）\n   - memory/state.json（初始状态）\n   - log/run.md（空日志）\n3. loopcli 下一轮自动发现并启动该 Agent\n\n## 示例\n```bash\nloopcli create engineering-frontend-developer --task \"开发登录页面\"\nloopcli create engineering-code-reviewer --task \"审查 PR #42\"\nloopcli create design-ui-designer --task \"设计仪表盘界面\"\n```\n","numLines":31,"startLine":1,"totalLines":31}}}
