{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_a52d96461798438397830da1","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\nHere are the full contents of both files:\n\n## tasks.json\n\nThe file contains a list of 28 tasks, with tasks #1 through #14 completed. Here are the key details for tasks #13 and #14:\n\n### Task #13 (路径配置化)\n- **ID**: 13\n- **Status**: `done`\n- **Title**: \"#13 路径配置化：消除硬编码路径\"\n- **Description**: \"将 loopcli_lib.py 中 LOOPCLI_ROOT 硬编码路径改为通过环境变量 LOOPCLI_ROOT 或 CLI 参数动态获取。消除 sys.path.insert hack。确保所有模块通过统一入口发现根目录。保留向后兼容。更新 CONFIGURATION.md。\"\n- **Created**: 2026-05-21\n- **Assignee**: engineering-frontend-developer\n- **Completed**: 2026-05-21 12:55:25\n\n### Task #14 (原子写入+SSE心跳)\n- **ID**: 14\n- **Status**: `done`\n- **Title**: \"#14 原子写入与SSE心跳机制\"\n- **Description**: \"1) write_json 改为原子写入：使用 tempfile.NamedTemporaryFile + os.replace 确保写入过程中崩溃不损坏文件。2) SSE 添加心跳机制：每30秒发送 ': heartbeat\\\\n\\\\n' 注释帧，防止客户端/代理超时断开。3) 更新相关测试覆盖。\"\n- **Created**: 2026-05-21\n- **Assignee**: engineering-frontend-developer\n- **Completed**: 2026-05-21 13:01:14\n\nAll previous tasks (#1-#12) are also marked as `done`, indicating that the engineering-frontend-developer has completed all assigned work.\n\n## state.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"engineering-frontend-developer\",\n  \"status\": \"idle\",\n  \"current_task\": null,\n  \"last_run\": \"2026-05-21 13:02:43\",\n  \"run_count\": 125,\n  \"created\": \"2026-05-21\"\n}\n```\n\nThe agent is currently in an `idle` state with no active tasks. The last run was on May 21, 2026, at 13:02:43, and the agent has completed 125 total runs."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a11b390c-8618-467f-b876-d1d624ad9195","uuid":"ea370c2a-9915-4402-bdaf-4bc017a50469","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:04:47.851Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read the file D:/loopcli/engineering-frontend-developer/memory/tasks.json and D:/loopcli/engineering-frontend-developer/memory/state.json